(795990, 88333, 19952, '<td valign="top">Wow! So that''s what''s at the center of my hydrangea flowers. Really excellent macro and a nice purple shot. Great job!</td>', 'Wow! So that''s what''s at the center of my hydrangea flowers. Really excellent macro and a nice purple shot. Great job!', '2004-07-05 06:22:20.000000', NULL, 1),
