(795992, 88207, 19952, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait. I think this shot would actually be better with a bit sharper focus, but it turned out well like this too. Good job.</td>', 'Very nice portrait. I think this shot would actually be better with a bit sharper focus, but it turned out well like this too. Good job.', '2004-07-05 06:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(795993, 88568, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot, but I think it would have been better without the wind filter. Still, it came out really nice - great job on the photo.</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot, but I think it would have been better without the wind filter. Still, it came out really nice - great job on the photo.', '2004-07-05 06:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(795995, 88314, 19952, '<td valign="top">Hilarious! And the shot came out pretty nice too. ;-) Very fun shot.</td>', 'Hilarious! And the shot came out pretty nice too. ;-) Very fun shot.', '2004-07-05 06:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(795996, 88301, 19952, '<td valign="top">Great use of light in this shot and really crisp focus. Very nice job!</td>', 'Great use of light in this shot and really crisp focus. Very nice job!', '2004-07-05 06:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(795998, 86704, 19952, '<td valign="top">Nice subject, but I think it might be better if you shoot either all in the shade or all in the sun for this one, so that there isn''t a shadow line through the middle of the shot. Still, a good photo that meets the challenge well.</td>', 'Nice subject, but I think it might be better if you shoot either all in the shade or all in the sun for this one, so that there isn''t a shadow line through the middle of the shot. Still, a good photo that meets the challenge well.', '2004-07-05 06:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(795999, 88469, 19952, '<td valign="top">The only problem with this shot is that it''s hard to tell what she''s eating - it really blends into the background. But the rest of the shot is lit well and goes great for this challenge. Nice job!</td>', 'The only problem with this shot is that it''s hard to tell what she''s eating - it really blends into the background. But the rest of the shot is lit well and goes great for this challenge. Nice job!', '2004-07-05 06:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(796003, 88209, 19952, '<td valign="top">Absolutely hilrarious and a really fun photo! Great shot for this challenge.</td>', 'Absolutely hilrarious and a really fun photo! Great shot for this challenge.', '2004-07-05 06:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(796006, 88317, 19952, '<td valign="top">Wacky! I hope the fire department didn''t give you too much trouble when they came out to investigate the call. ;-) Very interesting, creative shot for this challenge.</td>', 'Wacky! I hope the fire department didn''t give you too much trouble when they came out to investigate the call. ;-) Very interesting, creative shot for this challenge.', '2004-07-05 06:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(796007, 86416, 19952, '<td valign="top">Very cute, but this probably would have been better on a different color background. The white blends in, but it would be much better if it stood out. Maybe yellow or green would have been better? Still a nice idea and a good shot.</td>', 'Very cute, but this probably would have been better on a different color background. The white blends in, but it would be much better if it stood out. Maybe yellow or green would have been better? Still a nice idea and a good shot.', '2004-07-05 06:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(796011, 88420, 888, '<td valign="top">nice but I''d have prefered a little more emphasis on the purple</td>', 'nice but I''d have prefered a little more emphasis on the purple', '2004-07-05 07:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(796012, 88314, 888, '<td valign="top">argh its a fruit massacre.<br/> <br/>nice pic, I hop you made it all into a smoothie afterwards!!</td>', 'argh its a fruit massacre. nice pic, I hop you made it all into a smoothie afterwards!!', '2004-07-05 07:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(796015, 87976, 888, '<td valign="top">now thats a grape shot, I hope you don''t get pipped to the post.  Very vine indeed</td>', 'now thats a grape shot, I hope you don''t get pipped to the post.  Very vine indeed', '2004-07-05 07:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(796026, 88569, 888, '<td valign="top">I''m not seeing any purple here.  Sorry, I just don''t get it.</td>', 'I''m not seeing any purple here.  Sorry, I just don''t get it.', '2004-07-05 07:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(796027, 88317, 888, '<td valign="top">wow, what a great capture.  It almost looks like a fabric, great texture.<br/> <br/>My only fault would be that I find the border distracting</td>', 'wow, what a great capture.  It almost looks like a fabric, great texture. My only fault would be that I find the border distracting', '2004-07-05 07:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(796028, 88529, 888, '<td valign="top">cool, is that a knuckle? or an elephants knee?!?</td>', 'cool, is that a knuckle? or an elephants knee?!?', '2004-07-05 07:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(796029, 86809, 888, '<td valign="top">nice combination of cold looking water and warm looking sky</td>', 'nice combination of cold looking water and warm looking sky', '2004-07-05 07:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(796035, 88569, 22781, '<td valign="top">I think this is funny, good execution, but where''s the purple?</td>', 'I think this is funny, good execution, but where''s the purple?', '2004-07-05 08:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(796071, 88047, 5822, '<td valign="top">Love the colors here and this pic is so top heavy, I feel it''s going to fall forward right out of the monitor :).  I guess that''s the point, right? Good job.</td>', 'Love the colors here and this pic is so top heavy, I feel it''s going to fall forward right out of the monitor :).  I guess that''s the point, right? Good job.', '2004-07-05 09:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(796074, 88467, 14656, '<td valign="top">This certainly suggests or depicts purple!  Any reason the composition is not centered and slightly to the left? Also, I''m not sure if I like the layout of the bottom 2 swatches (single color cards). Would have been nice to have a consistent pattern.</td>', 'This certainly suggests or depicts purple!  Any reason the composition is not centered and slightly to the left? Also, I''m not sure if I like the layout of the bottom 2 swatches (single color cards). Would have been nice to have a consistent pattern.', '2004-07-05 09:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(796075, 86416, 14656, '<td valign="top">Nice idea but the image is cropped a little too tightly, especially on the left side. I''m also wondering why the purple bottle has bits of green in it? Personally, I would''ve gotten lower in the shot and gave it more perspective, rather than shooting overhead but that could be personal preference.</td>', 'Nice idea but the image is cropped a little too tightly, especially on the left side. I''m also wondering why the purple bottle has bits of green in it? Personally, I would''ve gotten lower in the shot and gave it more perspective, rather than shooting overhead but that could be personal preference.', '2004-07-05 09:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(796076, 88417, 14656, '<td valign="top">Strong contrast and interesting use of negative space. I''m wondering how processed this image is as the reddish areas seem grainy and blown out.</td>', 'Strong contrast and interesting use of negative space. I''m wondering how processed this image is as the reddish areas seem grainy and blown out.', '2004-07-05 09:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(796078, 88576, 14656, '<td valign="top">Seems a tad overexposed and oversharpened although that could be the effect of resizing.</td>', 'Seems a tad overexposed and oversharpened although that could be the effect of resizing.', '2004-07-05 09:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(796080, 88334, 14656, '<td valign="top">I notice some purple fringing but I suppose that''s acceptable for this challenge ;)<br/> <br/>Would''ve liked to see a bit wider angle and not so tightly cropped so the viewer could get some perspective or sense of proportion or scale of the image.</td>', 'I notice some purple fringing but I suppose that''s acceptable for this challenge ;) Would''ve liked to see a bit wider angle and not so tightly cropped so the viewer could get some perspective or sense of proportion or scale of the image.', '2004-07-05 09:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(796082, 87649, 14656, '<td valign="top">Certainly fits the challenge. I myself contemplated on photographing the same subject but opted not to.<br/> <br/>Focus of your image feels a little soft. Background is also distracting and the slanted angle of the box is not effective as the image is too tightly cropped.</td>', 'Certainly fits the challenge. I myself contemplated on photographing the same subject but opted not to. Focus of your image feels a little soft. Background is also distracting and the slanted angle of the box is not effective as the image is too tightly cropped.', '2004-07-05 09:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(796083, 87157, 14656, '<td valign="top">Image appears noisy/grainy and I''m not sure if it adds or detracts to the effect. My eyes are immediatel drawn to the blurry highlights on the model''s chest, specifically the large blob, 2nd from the left. I feel as if it takes the attention away from the model''s face or eyes, even if they are in focus.</td>', 'Image appears noisy/grainy and I''m not sure if it adds or detracts to the effect. My eyes are immediatel drawn to the blurry highlights on the model''s chest, specifically the large blob, 2nd from the left. I feel as if it takes the attention away from the model''s face or eyes, even if they are in focus.', '2004-07-05 09:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(796086, 88409, 14656, '<td valign="top">Bottom right of the foreground is overexposed but adds strong contrast to the dark cars. Perhaps diffusing the light would''ve given softer highlights. Nice DOF but I would''ve liked to see the closest car (far left) in focus.  Car 2nd from left seems to be the focus of your picture, regardless of the cars surrounding it.</td>', 'Bottom right of the foreground is overexposed but adds strong contrast to the dark cars. Perhaps diffusing the light would''ve given softer highlights. Nice DOF but I would''ve liked to see the closest car (far left) in focus.  Car 2nd from left seems to be the focus of your picture, regardless of the cars surrounding it.', '2004-07-05 09:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(796087, 88262, 14656, '<td valign="top">Image looks ever so slightly oversharpened as the bokeh in your background seem to have hard edges instead of being soft and blurry. Nice composition and leading lines.</td>', 'Image looks ever so slightly oversharpened as the bokeh in your background seem to have hard edges instead of being soft and blurry. Nice composition and leading lines.', '2004-07-05 09:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(796088, 88524, 14656, '<td valign="top">Great picture! From the thumbnail, I thought it was a jellyfish. Nice sharp focus and good contrast. Not sure if the pink/purple hue was from lighting or photoshop but either way, good job.</td>', 'Great picture! From the thumbnail, I thought it was a jellyfish. Nice sharp focus and good contrast. Not sure if the pink/purple hue was from lighting or photoshop but either way, good job.', '2004-07-05 09:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(796089, 88442, 14656, '<td valign="top">My eyes for some reason are drawn to the orange or the bee. Perhaps zooming in closer or having more of your frame consist of petals, the viewer would get the idea that the purple area was the subject of your photo.. at least for me anyway.</td>', 'My eyes for some reason are drawn to the orange or the bee. Perhaps zooming in closer or having more of your frame consist of petals, the viewer would get the idea that the purple area was the subject of your photo.. at least for me anyway.', '2004-07-05 09:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(796090, 86489, 14656, '<td valign="top">Ineteresting. After debating which way your photo looks better, landscape or portrait, I decided portrait was the better way to go. Good decision.</td>', 'Ineteresting. After debating which way your photo looks better, landscape or portrait, I decided portrait was the better way to go. Good decision.', '2004-07-05 09:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(796091, 88525, 14656, '<td valign="top">Lighting seems very soft and delicate for this photo. Almost appears hazy. Would''ve liked stronger contrast, but that could be personal preference. Had this been darker, the woodgrain on the left and the details of the boy would be lost since they are so subtle. Also, that vertical "streak" in the clouds above the boy''s head, adjacent to the tops of the weeds looks out of place and distracting. I would''ve cloned it out.  Otherwise, nice composition.</td>', 'Lighting seems very soft and delicate for this photo. Almost appears hazy. Would''ve liked stronger contrast, but that could be personal preference. Had this been darker, the woodgrain on the left and the details of the boy would be lost since they are so subtle. Also, that vertical "streak" in the clouds above the boy''s head, adjacent to the tops of the weeds looks out of place and distracting. I would''ve cloned it out.  Otherwise, nice composition.', '2004-07-05 09:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(796092, 88619, 14656, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp focus and interesting backround. Not sure of what I''m looking at, but it''s a great photo and definitely fits the challenge. Would''ve liked to see a bit smoother transition in the background, fading from purple to silver rather than the somewhat abrupt change above the top of the star. There almost appears to be a hard edge to it.</td>', 'Nice sharp focus and interesting backround. Not sure of what I''m looking at, but it''s a great photo and definitely fits the challenge. Would''ve liked to see a bit smoother transition in the background, fading from purple to silver rather than the somewhat abrupt change above the top of the star. There almost appears to be a hard edge to it.', '2004-07-05 09:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(796094, 88568, 14656, '<td valign="top">Image appears heavily processed and applied some sort of motion blur filter. Would''ve liked to see a bit more natural color. Nice crop/framing though.</td>', 'Image appears heavily processed and applied some sort of motion blur filter. Would''ve liked to see a bit more natural color. Nice crop/framing though.', '2004-07-05 09:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(796096, 86464, 14656, '<td valign="top">Excellent DOF and nice sharp focus. My mind said "oh no.." when I first read the title before the image loaded but was pleasantly surprised to find this. Beautiful shot! Background appears a tad grainy which could have resulted from sharpening.</td>', 'Excellent DOF and nice sharp focus. My mind said "oh no.." when I first read the title before the image loaded but was pleasantly surprised to find this. Beautiful shot! Background appears a tad grainy which could have resulted from sharpening.', '2004-07-05 09:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(796097, 88287, 14656, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast of colors which I think works well here due to the cloudy/muggy Chicago skyline. One question though, why does everything appear to have sharp focus (people, benches, leaves, fence, boat, buildings) EXCEPT the flowers? I wonder what the shot would look like with a shallow DOF with the flowers in focus and everything else slightly blurred but not too much.</td>', 'Nice contrast of colors which I think works well here due to the cloudy/muggy Chicago skyline. One question though, why does everything appear to have sharp focus (people, benches, leaves, fence, boat, buildings) EXCEPT the flowers? I wonder what the shot would look like with a shallow DOF with the flowers in focus and everything else slightly blurred but not too much.', '2004-07-05 09:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(796098, 88420, 14656, '<td valign="top">This image contains purple but the theme of "purple" is not suggested to me when I see it. Nice crop on the top but I wouldn''t cut off so much at the bottom. I''d have liked to see at least the bottom of the basket and some sky beneath it for reference.</td>', 'This image contains purple but the theme of "purple" is not suggested to me when I see it. Nice crop on the top but I wouldn''t cut off so much at the bottom. I''d have liked to see at least the bottom of the basket and some sky beneath it for reference.', '2004-07-05 09:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(796099, 88066, 14656, '<td valign="top">The weeds in the foreground appear slightly purple, providing good balance with the purple thingymabob on the left. Nice sharp focus and DOF.</td>', 'The weeds in the foreground appear slightly purple, providing good balance with the purple thingymabob on the left. Nice sharp focus and DOF.', '2004-07-05 09:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(796102, 88566, 14656, '<td valign="top">The purple looks natural but the aqua/teal color looks "out of place." The background also has the same hue resulting in a painted/watercolor look, rather than a photo.</td>', 'The purple looks natural but the aqua/teal color looks "out of place." The background also has the same hue resulting in a painted/watercolor look, rather than a photo.', '2004-07-05 09:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(796103, 88350, 20435, '<td valign="top">amazing!</td>', 'amazing!', '2004-07-05 09:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(796105, 88437, 14656, '<td valign="top">The chips at the top of the frame seem to be in focus (background) while the closest chips in the foreground are blurry. I''d like to have seen a better composition or arrangement of chips, maybe a stack fanned out or a pyramid-like pile with 1 chip on top. Chips here appear totally random and the eyes wander all about, looking to find the focus of this image.</td>', 'The chips at the top of the frame seem to be in focus (background) while the closest chips in the foreground are blurry. I''d like to have seen a better composition or arrangement of chips, maybe a stack fanned out or a pyramid-like pile with 1 chip on top. Chips here appear totally random and the eyes wander all about, looking to find the focus of this image.', '2004-07-05 09:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(796108, 88416, 14656, '<td valign="top">The stack (or pile I should say) of lumber in the background looks like a potential avalanche or fire hazard. The chaotic nature leads my eyes straight to the upper left, ignoring the plastic furniture. I''d suggest a much less busy background or at least something scenic to add to the atmosphere and ambiance of "eating out" as your title suggests, rather than detracting from it.</td>', 'The stack (or pile I should say) of lumber in the background looks like a potential avalanche or fire hazard. The chaotic nature leads my eyes straight to the upper left, ignoring the plastic furniture. I''d suggest a much less busy background or at least something scenic to add to the atmosphere and ambiance of "eating out" as your title suggests, rather than detracting from it.', '2004-07-05 09:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(796111, 88306, 14656, '<td valign="top">For some reason, the ripples look slightly slanted (uneven horizon). Also, The image seems a bit too tightly cropped. I''d have eased off a bit on the sides and shown more top. The center of the ripples seems to be smack dab in the center of your image and I''d liked to have seen more attention to the rule of thirds verticalwise.</td>', 'For some reason, the ripples look slightly slanted (uneven horizon). Also, The image seems a bit too tightly cropped. I''d have eased off a bit on the sides and shown more top. The center of the ripples seems to be smack dab in the center of your image and I''d liked to have seen more attention to the rule of thirds verticalwise.', '2004-07-05 09:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(796112, 86981, 14656, '<td valign="top">Nice focus and great contrast. The black background really makes the image pop! Lighting is excellent as well as I know how easy it is to overexpose these types of shots.</td>', 'Nice focus and great contrast. The black background really makes the image pop! Lighting is excellent as well as I know how easy it is to overexpose these types of shots.', '2004-07-05 10:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(796118, 88316, 14656, '<td valign="top">I see blue and slight innuendo of purple, but "purple light?" The model''s face is warmly lit, not suggestive of purple at all. Neither is the chain pull for the light. Nice composition but I feel as if the lampshade is the subject, not the light being emitted under or through it. I guess what I''m trying to say is the title could use improvement. Lampshade also appears slightly out of focus.</td>', 'I see blue and slight innuendo of purple, but "purple light?" The model''s face is warmly lit, not suggestive of purple at all. Neither is the chain pull for the light. Nice composition but I feel as if the lampshade is the subject, not the light being emitted under or through it. I guess what I''m trying to say is the title could use improvement. Lampshade also appears slightly out of focus.', '2004-07-05 10:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(796121, 88174, 14656, '<td valign="top">Lavendar background and border help to enhance the flowers in the girl''s hair. Challenge met!</td>', 'Lavendar background and border help to enhance the flowers in the girl''s hair. Challenge met!', '2004-07-05 10:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(796122, 88094, 14656, '<td valign="top">Well executed and beautiful composition! Not much I could suggest without being nitpicky, other than cloning out the white "scratches" on the black/dark purple pencil shaft.</td>', 'Well executed and beautiful composition! Not much I could suggest without being nitpicky, other than cloning out the white "scratches" on the black/dark purple pencil shaft.', '2004-07-05 10:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(796123, 88575, 14656, '<td valign="top">Strong contrast but the highlights in the center and also the stem seem a bit overexposed (and yes my monitor is calibrated). Noticeable effects of sharpening. Also would''ve cloned out the white specks (dust?) on the petals. Composition feels slightly heavy to the leftside also due to the stem. Would''ve placed the flower offcenter to the right to balance it.</td>', 'Strong contrast but the highlights in the center and also the stem seem a bit overexposed (and yes my monitor is calibrated). Noticeable effects of sharpening. Also would''ve cloned out the white specks (dust?) on the petals. Composition feels slightly heavy to the leftside also due to the stem. Would''ve placed the flower offcenter to the right to balance it.', '2004-07-05 10:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(796124, 87781, 14656, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and DOF. Spikey ball on left appears in sharper focus than blue/purple flower although it could be an optical illusion.</td>', 'Nice composition and DOF. Spikey ball on left appears in sharper focus than blue/purple flower although it could be an optical illusion.', '2004-07-05 10:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(796125, 87520, 14656, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. Would''ve brought up the levels to brighten the image. Even a quick autolevel would''ve sufficed. Mac user?</td>', 'Nice composition. Would''ve brought up the levels to brighten the image. Even a quick autolevel would''ve sufficed. Mac user?', '2004-07-05 10:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(796127, 88398, 14656, '<td valign="top">Image is out of focus and overexposed. At first I didn''t like how the burst was cropped but I think it works in this composition.</td>', 'Image is out of focus and overexposed. At first I didn''t like how the burst was cropped but I think it works in this composition.', '2004-07-05 10:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(796131, 87685, 14656, '<td valign="top">Probably wouldn''t have noticed the lipstick on the glass w/o the title and think it would''ve been much more noticeable on the frontside of the left glass. Did you consider purple lipstick? It is rather subtle the way it''s positioned now.<br/> <br/>Focus apears soft and image is a cropped a little close to the bottom of the glass. Very busy composition here, not sure what the focus is. I''m immediately drawn to the stems of the wineglasses and the wine itself. Perhaps eliminating a few objects would help i.e. wineglasses on the sheets, covering the pillow. You''d have eliminated the lamp, nightstand, and doily which is 50% of your image.</td>', 'Probably wouldn''t have noticed the lipstick on the glass w/o the title and think it would''ve been much more noticeable on the frontside of the left glass. Did you consider purple lipstick? It is rather subtle the way it''s positioned now. Focus apears soft and image is a cropped a little close to the bottom of the glass. Very busy composition here, not sure what the focus is. I''m immediately drawn to the stems of the wineglasses and the wine itself. Perhaps eliminating a few objects would help i.e. wineglasses on the sheets, covering the pillow. You''d have eliminated the lamp, nightstand, and doily which is 50% of your image.', '2004-07-05 10:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(796132, 88298, 14656, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and use of shadows. Very emotive pose. Great job!</td>', 'Nice lighting and use of shadows. Very emotive pose. Great job!', '2004-07-05 10:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(796134, 88059, 14656, '<td valign="top">Appears oversharpened and a little grainy. Tight crop works for this composition but I''m a little put off by the green sludge.</td>', 'Appears oversharpened and a little grainy. Tight crop works for this composition but I''m a little put off by the green sludge.', '2004-07-05 10:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(796135, 88161, 14656, '<td valign="top">Image lacks sharp focus. Interesting lines and composition, almost appears painterly.</td>', 'Image lacks sharp focus. Interesting lines and composition, almost appears painterly.', '2004-07-05 10:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(796138, 87305, 14656, '<td valign="top">Not sure what''s going on, but the grass beneath the taller mushroom appears hazy.. Camera must be experiencing a mushroom trip ;)</td>', 'Not sure what''s going on, but the grass beneath the taller mushroom appears hazy.. Camera must be experiencing a mushroom trip ;)', '2004-07-05 10:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(796144, 88469, 14656, '<td valign="top">Nice. Subtle. Background seems a little dark but provides nice contrast to the fair-skinned model. Perhaps overexposing 1 or 2 more stops would''ve brightened up the image nicely. I autoleveled your image and saw much greater contrast and potential to become brighter in post processing. I would''ve scored this much higher if the lighting was better. Also would''ve liked to see the tip of her elbow but that''s subjective.</td>', 'Nice. Subtle. Background seems a little dark but provides nice contrast to the fair-skinned model. Perhaps overexposing 1 or 2 more stops would''ve brightened up the image nicely. I autoleveled your image and saw much greater contrast and potential to become brighter in post processing. I would''ve scored this much higher if the lighting was better. Also would''ve liked to see the tip of her elbow but that''s subjective.', '2004-07-05 10:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(796149, 88358, 14656, '<td valign="top">Image is cropped a little too tightly for my taste. Would''ve backed up a bit and given a slightly wider angle. Noise from the effects of (over)sharpening are visible. NeatImage or other noise reduction software would''ve cleaned this up nicely.</td>', 'Image is cropped a little too tightly for my taste. Would''ve backed up a bit and given a slightly wider angle. Noise from the effects of (over)sharpening are visible. NeatImage or other noise reduction software would''ve cleaned this up nicely.', '2004-07-05 10:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(796159, 88390, 14656, '<td valign="top">Strong contrast and grain provide a classy retro look which I like. Then I begin to wonder if this falls into my category of "colorized purple for the sake of meeting the challenge.." ? A shot like this borders on digital art, specifically because it uses the effects of post processing to achieve the purple or "wow" effect.</td>', 'Strong contrast and grain provide a classy retro look which I like. Then I begin to wonder if this falls into my category of "colorized purple for the sake of meeting the challenge.." ? A shot like this borders on digital art, specifically because it uses the effects of post processing to achieve the purple or "wow" effect.', '2004-07-05 10:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(796161, 88376, 14656, '<td valign="top">Too much contrast and overexposed. I see green included in the chromatic abberation as well as the typical purple fringing.</td>', 'Too much contrast and overexposed. I see green included in the chromatic abberation as well as the typical purple fringing.', '2004-07-05 10:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(796164, 87581, 14656, '<td valign="top">Appears to be heavily photoshopped. I see little photographic integrity as this could be entirely produced from scratch using paintbrushes and filters.</td>', 'Appears to be heavily photoshopped. I see little photographic integrity as this could be entirely produced from scratch using paintbrushes and filters.', '2004-07-05 10:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(796165, 88580, 12857, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture.  The color is striking.  I saw starfish like that once in Oregon.   Perfect placement in the photo.  Good job.</td>', 'Beautiful capture.  The color is striking.  I saw starfish like that once in Oregon.   Perfect placement in the photo.  Good job.', '2004-07-05 10:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(796167, 88390, 12857, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love the composition of the photo.   I wish the third gill in had her head down.  O i have to complain about something when the shot is so good.!! :)</td>', 'I absolutely love the composition of the photo.   I wish the third gill in had her head down.  O i have to complain about something when the shot is so good.!! :)', '2004-07-05 10:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(796168, 88325, 14656, '<td valign="top">Nice attempt. I like the red background but the purple bee and pollen doesn''t go well with me. Excellent photo but I ask you, "would the colors be edited this way had it not been for the challenge?"</td>', 'Nice attempt. I like the red background but the purple bee and pollen doesn''t go well with me. Excellent photo but I ask you, "would the colors be edited this way had it not been for the challenge?"', '2004-07-05 10:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(796176, 88306, 12857, '<td valign="top">Great concept.  Nice photo.  I wish the ripples were crisper.  On the other hand a soft purple rain would suggest the ripples should be softer.  O I could debate myself all day.  Good job!!</td>', 'Great concept.  Nice photo.  I wish the ripples were crisper.  On the other hand a soft purple rain would suggest the ripples should be softer.  O I could debate myself all day.  Good job!!', '2004-07-05 10:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(796179, 88032, 14656, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. I''m wondering why the reflected light under the shadow of the paintcan is yellow while the highlights on the side are bluish in tone. I would''ve have desaturated those two elements I just mentioned as well as giving the background a pure white tone. Lighting appears warm. Excellent composition! It''s just the lighting that bothers me.</td>', 'Nice composition. I''m wondering why the reflected light under the shadow of the paintcan is yellow while the highlights on the side are bluish in tone. I would''ve have desaturated those two elements I just mentioned as well as giving the background a pure white tone. Lighting appears warm. Excellent composition! It''s just the lighting that bothers me.', '2004-07-05 10:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(796181, 88214, 12857, '<td valign="top">I get it.  I hope others do too and dont drop you commetns like.  " Wheres the purple?" Or score you less than five because you did not meet the challenge.!!<br/>dc</td>', 'I get it.  I hope others do too and dont drop you commetns like.  " Wheres the purple?" Or score you less than five because you did not meet the challenge.!!dc', '2004-07-05 10:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(796184, 88573, 14656, '<td valign="top">Nice vibrant colors. Transition between orange and blue seemed to have been manually blurred in post. Image appears oversharpened.</td>', 'Nice vibrant colors. Transition between orange and blue seemed to have been manually blurred in post. Image appears oversharpened.', '2004-07-05 10:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(796188, 88616, 14656, '<td valign="top">Image lacks overall sharpness. Seems hazy/washed out. A level adjustment would''ve helped with contrast.</td>', 'Image lacks overall sharpness. Seems hazy/washed out. A level adjustment would''ve helped with contrast.', '2004-07-05 10:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(796190, 88133, 12857, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!!!!!!  Finally something original.   This is one of the best of the Bunch!!!  So much going on.  I love it that I can only see one eye.</td>', 'Beautiful!!!!!!  Finally something original.   This is one of the best of the Bunch!!!  So much going on.  I love it that I can only see one eye.', '2004-07-05 10:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(796191, 88307, 14656, '<td valign="top">If selective desaturation was used, I would''ve desaturated the grass as well. Cropped a bit too tightly on the sides and top of bench appears slanted.</td>', 'If selective desaturation was used, I would''ve desaturated the grass as well. Cropped a bit too tightly on the sides and top of bench appears slanted.', '2004-07-05 10:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(796193, 88527, 12857, '<td valign="top">I dont know if your camera could do it or not but a macro shot of just the onion flesh may have  given very interesting and surprising results.  I may try this one myself.  Thanks for the inspiration!!!</td>', 'I dont know if your camera could do it or not but a macro shot of just the onion flesh may have  given very interesting and surprising results.  I may try this one myself.  Thanks for the inspiration!!!', '2004-07-05 10:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(796194, 87581, 10720, '<td valign="top">It has been so post-processed, it doesn''t look like a photo to me anymore.  I fear this one will not do well because of the nature of the challenge.</td>', 'It has been so post-processed, it doesn''t look like a photo to me anymore.  I fear this one will not do well because of the nature of the challenge.', '2004-07-05 10:49:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(796195, 88366, 14656, '<td valign="top">Excellent DOF and contrast :) Interesting smirk on model''s face. Would''ve softened the light just a bit as it appears harsh on her face and in the reflection of her eyes.</td>', 'Excellent DOF and contrast :) Interesting smirk on model''s face. Would''ve softened the light just a bit as it appears harsh on her face and in the reflection of her eyes.', '2004-07-05 10:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(796200, 88375, 14656, '<td valign="top">An autolevel adjustment would''ve helped bring out the whites in the highlights. Nice composition, just a little dark.</td>', 'An autolevel adjustment would''ve helped bring out the whites in the highlights. Nice composition, just a little dark.', '2004-07-05 10:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(796201, 88340, 14656, '<td valign="top">Very strong contrast and globe seems overexposed. Would''ve used the flash for this pic to help brighten up the figure while keeping a faster shutter to capture more detail in the ball.</td>', 'Very strong contrast and globe seems overexposed. Would''ve used the flash for this pic to help brighten up the figure while keeping a faster shutter to capture more detail in the ball.', '2004-07-05 10:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(796203, 88561, 12857, '<td valign="top">This was the idea I was thinking of.  I am glad I did not make it in time!!  Maybe your photo will score higher because of it.   I alwasy  had a penchant for these dispersion photos!<br/>Good job.  <br/>dc</td>', 'This was the idea I was thinking of.  I am glad I did not make it in time!!  Maybe your photo will score higher because of it.   I alwasy  had a penchant for these dispersion photos!Good job.  dc', '2004-07-05 10:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(796205, 88261, 14656, '<td valign="top">Looks like a full res crop. Image appears grainy and out of focus. A bit lacking in the post processing department. Would''ve cropped a tad off the bottom but not much. Feels like a rushed attempt or unfinished snapshot of a work in progress.</td>', 'Looks like a full res crop. Image appears grainy and out of focus. A bit lacking in the post processing department. Would''ve cropped a tad off the bottom but not much. Feels like a rushed attempt or unfinished snapshot of a work in progress.', '2004-07-05 10:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(796207, 88436, 12857, '<td valign="top">Simply beautiful.  The color is fantastic!!</td>', 'Simply beautiful.  The color is fantastic!!', '2004-07-05 10:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(796209, 88561, 14656, '<td valign="top">Great idea! Would''ve liked to see a bit sharper focus as image appears a little blurry and soft.</td>', 'Great idea! Would''ve liked to see a bit sharper focus as image appears a little blurry and soft.', '2004-07-05 10:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(796210, 88170, 14603, '<td valign="top">Personally, I find this an interesting image with good composition and the blend of blue and purple giving it vibrancy.<br/>However, it`s not the type of work that gets a good reception on DPC normally..let`s hope this is an exception...8</td>', 'Personally, I find this an interesting image with good composition and the blend of blue and purple giving it vibrancy.However, it`s not the type of work that gets a good reception on DPC normally..let`s hope this is an exception...8', '2004-07-05 10:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(796212, 88298, 12857, '<td valign="top">Luky duck to have such a beautiful model!!!  Great lighting and I mush say you both used the color purple well!!<br/>dc</td>', 'Luky duck to have such a beautiful model!!!  Great lighting and I mush say you both used the color purple well!!dc', '2004-07-05 10:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(796219, 87668, 14656, '<td valign="top">Took me a second to find the bug but it was a welcomed addition. A slightly narrower aperture would''ve gotten all the petals in focus as it appears soft around the outside edges. Nice soft background but could''ve used slightly more contrast, perhaps bringing up the levels to raise the highlights.</td>', 'Took me a second to find the bug but it was a welcomed addition. A slightly narrower aperture would''ve gotten all the petals in focus as it appears soft around the outside edges. Nice soft background but could''ve used slightly more contrast, perhaps bringing up the levels to raise the highlights.', '2004-07-05 10:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(796220, 88317, 12857, '<td valign="top">I dont know how you did this but bravo.  I was thinknig of something along thses lines but I just did nt know how to execute it.    Did you take any where you just have the smoke in the shot.  Or any with the smoke diffused?<br/>dc</td>', 'I dont know how you did this but bravo.  I was thinknig of something along thses lines but I just did nt know how to execute it.    Did you take any where you just have the smoke in the shot.  Or any with the smoke diffused?dc', '2004-07-05 10:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(796227, 87881, 14656, '<td valign="top">Interesting background but I''m not so sure about the foreground. Perhaps placing the doll on a completely white fore/background would''ve helped to keep focus on the doll. Shadow of the doll pretty harsh.</td>', 'Interesting background but I''m not so sure about the foreground. Perhaps placing the doll on a completely white fore/background would''ve helped to keep focus on the doll. Shadow of the doll pretty harsh.', '2004-07-05 11:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(796228, 87683, 14603, '<td valign="top">There have been many shots of this type submitted to various challenges in the past (mine included).. so they really have to have something special to offer and I think this does..the splash of yellow, which always contrasts well with purple, gives the image the lift it needs and adds to the overall abstract quality.<br/>Nice work</td>', 'There have been many shots of this type submitted to various challenges in the past (mine included).. so they really have to have something special to offer and I think this does..the splash of yellow, which always contrasts well with purple, gives the image the lift it needs and adds to the overall abstract quality.Nice work', '2004-07-05 11:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(796231, 88250, 14656, '<td valign="top">Nice framing, good angle.</td>', 'Nice framing, good angle.', '2004-07-05 11:00:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(796234, 88414, 14656, '<td valign="top">Great focus and DOF.</td>', 'Great focus and DOF.', '2004-07-05 11:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(796236, 86762, 14656, '<td valign="top">Would''ve cloned out black spot in upper left.</td>', 'Would''ve cloned out black spot in upper left.', '2004-07-05 11:02:09.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(796239, 88468, 14656, '<td valign="top">Sky is heavily overexposed and washed out.</td>', 'Sky is heavily overexposed and washed out.', '2004-07-05 11:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(796243, 86513, 14656, '<td valign="top">Strong lighting and interesting composition. Would''ve placed the flower in the middle more to the right as it appears too close to the center. Positioning the frame or cropping in this manner would also remove the distracting green in the upper right.</td>', 'Strong lighting and interesting composition. Would''ve placed the flower in the middle more to the right as it appears too close to the center. Positioning the frame or cropping in this manner would also remove the distracting green in the upper right.', '2004-07-05 11:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(796245, 87237, 14656, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF and framing. Appears sliiiiightly oversharpened.</td>', 'Nice DOF and framing. Appears sliiiiightly oversharpened.', '2004-07-05 11:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(796248, 88352, 14656, '<td valign="top">Blurry element in foreground and distracting shape in bottom right detracts from this picture. Would''ve appreciated an unobscured view of the classic. Shot this from a car window?<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-07-18 06:05:39.</i></td>', 'Blurry element in foreground and distracting shape in bottom right detracts from this picture. Would''ve appreciated an unobscured view of the classic. Shot this from a car window?', '2004-07-05 11:06:45.000000', '2004-07-18 07:05:39.000000', 1),
(796250, 88541, 14656, '<td valign="top">Lacks any interesting qualities. An embellished title would''ve shown at least some effort. Unimaginative and poorly thought out and executed.</td>', 'Lacks any interesting qualities. An embellished title would''ve shown at least some effort. Unimaginative and poorly thought out and executed.', '2004-07-05 11:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(796254, 88214, 14656, '<td valign="top">Another effect that we''ve seen before and must be technically executed well to score. There appears to be a white "smudge" in the blue half and as well in the bottom right of the red half. Could''ve been easily corrected in Photoshop. Wineglass also appears soft in focus.</td>', 'Another effect that we''ve seen before and must be technically executed well to score. There appears to be a white "smudge" in the blue half and as well in the bottom right of the red half. Could''ve been easily corrected in Photoshop. Wineglass also appears soft in focus.', '2004-07-05 11:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(796257, 87095, 14656, '<td valign="top">Image could benefit from being larger. Any smaller and they''d resemble a bunch of grapes.</td>', 'Image could benefit from being larger. Any smaller and they''d resemble a bunch of grapes.', '2004-07-05 11:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(796260, 88251, 14656, '<td valign="top">Focus is also soft to the point of being blurry. Good idea, could''ve been executed better.</td>', 'Focus is also soft to the point of being blurry. Good idea, could''ve been executed better.', '2004-07-05 11:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(796261, 88007, 14656, '<td valign="top">Very creative. Not so sure I would''ve cropped so much off the left side.</td>', 'Very creative. Not so sure I would''ve cropped so much off the left side.', '2004-07-05 11:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(796262, 88529, 14656, '<td valign="top">I''d never guess what this was had it not been for the title. Very abstract. Nice framing and choice of vertical composition.</td>', 'I''d never guess what this was had it not been for the title. Very abstract. Nice framing and choice of vertical composition.', '2004-07-05 11:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(796263, 86406, 14603, '<td valign="top">I like images that hit you in the face and this certainly does..there are some markings on the window frame that suggest post processing to darken the interior ?? 5 minutes cloning to clean them off would probably have been to your advantage...not a problem for me though..strong image..perfect for the challenge...9</td>', 'I like images that hit you in the face and this certainly does..there are some markings on the window frame that suggest post processing to darken the interior ?? 5 minutes cloning to clean them off would probably have been to your advantage...not a problem for me though..strong image..perfect for the challenge...9', '2004-07-05 11:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(796265, 88569, 14656, '<td valign="top">The only thing resembling "purple" I see is the pole in back of the Hear No Evil monkey next to the red pole. Other than that, this photo does not depict nor suggest purple. Bench is slanted and does not benefit from this abstract angle, even though shrine/wall in back is horizontally level.</td>', 'The only thing resembling "purple" I see is the pole in back of the Hear No Evil monkey next to the red pole. Other than that, this photo does not depict nor suggest purple. Bench is slanted and does not benefit from this abstract angle, even though shrine/wall in back is horizontally level.', '2004-07-05 11:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(796267, 88423, 14656, '<td valign="top">This is certainly purple alright.. an effect that could be applied to ANY photo. Why this one? Tallest sailboat in center is distracting.</td>', 'This is certainly purple alright.. an effect that could be applied to ANY photo. Why this one? Tallest sailboat in center is distracting.', '2004-07-05 11:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(796270, 87632, 14603, '<td valign="top">I never submitted to this challenge but this was something that I considered going for...you`ve done an excellent job.. it suits the macro approach..good lighting also.</td>', 'I never submitted to this challenge but this was something that I considered going for...you`ve done an excellent job.. it suits the macro approach..good lighting also.', '2004-07-05 11:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(796271, 88249, 14656, '<td valign="top">Image is heavily oversharpened. Where is the purple? The sky or the chromatic abberation around the lights? Nice composition, could''ve been technically executed much better.</td>', 'Image is heavily oversharpened. Where is the purple? The sky or the chromatic abberation around the lights? Nice composition, could''ve been technically executed much better.', '2004-07-05 11:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(796273, 88579, 14656, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture. Image appears grainy/noisy.</td>', 'Excellent capture. Image appears grainy/noisy.', '2004-07-05 11:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(796277, 88320, 14603, '<td valign="top">A different approach from the last thistle shot I viewed.. but equally effective..good lighting and nice, uncluttered background.<br/>I had considered going for this myself and now I`m glad I didn`t as I would`nt have bettered the ones I`ve seen.<br/></td>', 'A different approach from the last thistle shot I viewed.. but equally effective..good lighting and nice, uncluttered background.I had considered going for this myself and now I`m glad I didn`t as I would`nt have bettered the ones I`ve seen.', '2004-07-05 11:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(796278, 87976, 14656, '<td valign="top">I like your choice to name your entry "The Green Leaf" and have the leaf in focus, even though this is a purple challenge. Compositionwise, I''m not sure I like the 2 grapes one on top of the other. I would''ve cut out the grape at the bottom and placed it behind the leaf and 2nd grape on the right side higher than the grape on the far left, forming a triangle.</td>', 'I like your choice to name your entry "The Green Leaf" and have the leaf in focus, even though this is a purple challenge. Compositionwise, I''m not sure I like the 2 grapes one on top of the other. I would''ve cut out the grape at the bottom and placed it behind the leaf and 2nd grape on the right side higher than the grape on the far left, forming a triangle.', '2004-07-05 11:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(796281, 88342, 14656, '<td valign="top">Very moody. Nice lighting. Purple cloth and clouds appear grainy that would''ve been cleaned up nicely in NeatImage, giving it that finished look.</td>', 'Very moody. Nice lighting. Purple cloth and clouds appear grainy that would''ve been cleaned up nicely in NeatImage, giving it that finished look.', '2004-07-05 11:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(796283, 88411, 14656, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp focus. Doesn''t suffer from oversharpening or noise/grain. Flower in background a little too blurred for my taste. Nicely done.</td>', 'Nice sharp focus. Doesn''t suffer from oversharpening or noise/grain. Flower in background a little too blurred for my taste. Nicely done.', '2004-07-05 11:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(796286, 88383, 14656, '<td valign="top">Excellent focus and composition! One of the best flower pics I''ve seen in this challenge. Good contrast and lighting is perfect. I hope this scores highly.</td>', 'Excellent focus and composition! One of the best flower pics I''ve seen in this challenge. Good contrast and lighting is perfect. I hope this scores highly.', '2004-07-05 11:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(796287, 88075, 14656, '<td valign="top">Purple border too wide and distracting. Nice crop and photo but purple hue gives unnatural and unflattering look to model.</td>', 'Purple border too wide and distracting. Nice crop and photo but purple hue gives unnatural and unflattering look to model.', '2004-07-05 11:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(796288, 88038, 14656, '<td valign="top">Uninteresting composition. I''d much rather look at what''s planted above. Would''ve positioned the planter more to the right and much lower in the frame.</td>', 'Uninteresting composition. I''d much rather look at what''s planted above. Would''ve positioned the planter more to the right and much lower in the frame.', '2004-07-05 11:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(796290, 87818, 14656, '<td valign="top">Good job at not letting the petals get lost in the white background. That being said, image looks plain and boring. Would''ve liked to see the flower in its natural surroundings and environment. Flower looks sterile or lifeless.</td>', 'Good job at not letting the petals get lost in the white background. That being said, image looks plain and boring. Would''ve liked to see the flower in its natural surroundings and environment. Flower looks sterile or lifeless.', '2004-07-05 11:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(796292, 86610, 14656, '<td valign="top">Focus appears soft. Dominoes could''ve been arranged in a bit more imaginative or creative manner. Not enough variation. Image fails to grasp my attention.</td>', 'Focus appears soft. Dominoes could''ve been arranged in a bit more imaginative or creative manner. Not enough variation. Image fails to grasp my attention.', '2004-07-05 11:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(796294, 88170, 14656, '<td valign="top">The deep blues of the sky are very pleasing. The purples seem a bit on the red side. Horizon is tilted.</td>', 'The deep blues of the sky are very pleasing. The purples seem a bit on the red side. Horizon is tilted.', '2004-07-05 11:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(796296, 88313, 14656, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo, very abstract! Not exactly sure what I''m looking at but it''s an excellent capture.</td>', 'Beautiful photo, very abstract! Not exactly sure what I''m looking at but it''s an excellent capture.', '2004-07-05 11:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(796297, 88411, 14603, '<td valign="top">This is the third thistle shot I have come across (so far) and they are all excellent.<br/>Good subject, well captured.</td>', 'This is the third thistle shot I have come across (so far) and they are all excellent.Good subject, well captured.', '2004-07-05 11:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(796300, 88397, 14656, '<td valign="top">Image appears too soft and overexposed. Nice framing and composition although I would''ve cropped just a bit more off the top.</td>', 'Image appears too soft and overexposed. Nice framing and composition although I would''ve cropped just a bit more off the top.', '2004-07-05 11:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(796307, 88422, 14656, '<td valign="top">Would''ve cropped out the plant on the extreme far left and the leaves poking into frame far right. Otherwise, the vibrant purple helps bring life to the dull greens and grays to the rest of the photo.</td>', 'Would''ve cropped out the plant on the extreme far left and the leaves poking into frame far right. Otherwise, the vibrant purple helps bring life to the dull greens and grays to the rest of the photo.', '2004-07-05 11:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(796309, 88258, 14656, '<td valign="top">Would''ve lowered my perspective, basically getting on all fours and shooting parallel to the floor. Feet are cropped off and there is noticeable noise in the purple of the wall.</td>', 'Would''ve lowered my perspective, basically getting on all fours and shooting parallel to the floor. Feet are cropped off and there is noticeable noise in the purple of the wall.', '2004-07-05 11:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(796311, 88131, 14656, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, almost abstractlike. Would''ve appreciated much larger explosions. Appears as if you missed it, then captured the beginning of the next series of shots.</td>', 'Nice capture, almost abstractlike. Would''ve appreciated much larger explosions. Appears as if you missed it, then captured the beginning of the next series of shots.', '2004-07-05 11:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(796314, 88611, 14656, '<td valign="top">Can''t tell if this is a photo or a sketch. Blurred image only detracts from the portrait. Not sure what you were going for with this one.</td>', 'Can''t tell if this is a photo or a sketch. Blurred image only detracts from the portrait. Not sure what you were going for with this one.', '2004-07-05 11:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(796316, 88058, 14656, '<td valign="top">Other than being purple, what makes this an interesting photo?</td>', 'Other than being purple, what makes this an interesting photo?', '2004-07-05 11:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(796317, 86809, 14656, '<td valign="top">I see nothing purple but it could be argued that the blue and pink "suggest" purple. Nice composition of rocks leading to the horizon, very eye-pleasing.</td>', 'I see nothing purple but it could be argued that the blue and pink "suggest" purple. Nice composition of rocks leading to the horizon, very eye-pleasing.', '2004-07-05 11:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(796318, 88295, 14656, '<td valign="top">Would this have been colored purple had it not been for the challenge? Nice contrast and composition.</td>', 'Would this have been colored purple had it not been for the challenge? Nice contrast and composition.', '2004-07-05 11:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(796319, 88390, 14603, '<td valign="top">A different approach to the challenge from anything I`ve yet seen and enjoyably refreshing.....great shot..hope it does well</td>', 'A different approach to the challenge from anything I`ve yet seen and enjoyably refreshing.....great shot..hope it does well', '2004-07-05 11:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(796320, 88429, 14656, '<td valign="top">Background appears noisy. Nice composition and focus.</td>', 'Background appears noisy. Nice composition and focus.', '2004-07-05 11:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(796321, 88335, 14656, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF and composition. I''m wondering if the leaf at the top and top left were cropped out, would it make the composition stronger?<br/> <br/>I think the image would look too plain without it but feel there would need to be more leaf if they are going to remain and be much more deliberate.</td>', 'Nice DOF and composition. I''m wondering if the leaf at the top and top left were cropped out, would it make the composition stronger? I think the image would look too plain without it but feel there would need to be more leaf if they are going to remain and be much more deliberate.', '2004-07-05 11:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(796323, 88092, 14603, '<td valign="top">A good example of how an effective picture does not have to be complex.<br/>Nicely done</td>', 'A good example of how an effective picture does not have to be complex.Nicely done', '2004-07-05 11:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(796324, 87681, 14656, '<td valign="top">Not sure what I''m looking at but I''m trying to find something to focus on. Nothing appears in sharp focus.</td>', 'Not sure what I''m looking at but I''m trying to find something to focus on. Nothing appears in sharp focus.', '2004-07-05 11:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(796325, 88399, 14656, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of color. A bit too many boats make this image too busy. The pier is also slanted very subtle and should either be horizontal or deliberately skewed. My eyes want to focus on the pier because everything else is chaos.</td>', 'Interesting use of color. A bit too many boats make this image too busy. The pier is also slanted very subtle and should either be horizontal or deliberately skewed. My eyes want to focus on the pier because everything else is chaos.', '2004-07-05 11:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
