(796330, 88379, 14656, '<td valign="top">Blurred flowers in background directly on top of focused flowers a distraction. Otherwise, interesting composition.</td>', 'Blurred flowers in background directly on top of focused flowers a distraction. Otherwise, interesting composition.', '2004-07-05 11:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(796333, 86704, 14656, '<td valign="top">Having trouble finding what to focus on. The tall weed bottom left or green plant in upper left seems to draw attention, making the focus of this photo anti-purple. I''d have either zoomed in on a small group of flowers or moved so far back, the purple were abstract specks. This is somewhere in between and just makes for a busy photo.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-07-18 06:06:13.</i></td>', 'Having trouble finding what to focus on. The tall weed bottom left or green plant in upper left seems to draw attention, making the focus of this photo anti-purple. I''d have either zoomed in on a small group of flowers or moved so far back, the purple were abstract specks. This is somewhere in between and just makes for a busy photo.', '2004-07-05 11:53:26.000000', '2004-07-18 07:06:13.000000', 1),
(796335, 88380, 14656, '<td valign="top">Nicely executed. Would''ve pulled much farther back as to capture more of the purple light effect on the background. Image cropped a little close to the red flask and blue flask is centered. I''d give a little more clearance on the left and shifted the blue to be offcenter to the left, balancing the purple casted light.</td>', 'Nicely executed. Would''ve pulled much farther back as to capture more of the purple light effect on the background. Image cropped a little close to the red flask and blue flask is centered. I''d give a little more clearance on the left and shifted the blue to be offcenter to the left, balancing the purple casted light.', '2004-07-05 11:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(796338, 88090, 14656, '<td valign="top">Symmetrical in theory (and title) but not composition wise. Since flower is "leaning" to the left, I wouldn''t have minded if the stem was centered. Still, the right side feels heavier because of the dark trees in the background.</td>', 'Symmetrical in theory (and title) but not composition wise. Since flower is "leaning" to the left, I wouldn''t have minded if the stem was centered. Still, the right side feels heavier because of the dark trees in the background.', '2004-07-05 11:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(796339, 86420, 14656, '<td valign="top">Nice angle and perspective. Spider also adds to the shot.</td>', 'Nice angle and perspective. Spider also adds to the shot.', '2004-07-05 11:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(796342, 88467, 6100, '<td valign="top">Good concept for this theme! It isn''t easy to define but "I know it when I see it!"</td>', 'Good concept for this theme! It isn''t easy to define but "I know it when I see it!"', '2004-07-05 11:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(796343, 88194, 14656, '<td valign="top">Bee appears a little soft on the focus but I know how hard it is to capture these little suckers! (I had to use a dead one for my self portrait amongst other reasons and potential threats of handling a live bee). Still, even the flowers seem a bit soft. Excellent composition, only gripe is the focus.</td>', 'Bee appears a little soft on the focus but I know how hard it is to capture these little suckers! (I had to use a dead one for my self portrait amongst other reasons and potential threats of handling a live bee). Still, even the flowers seem a bit soft. Excellent composition, only gripe is the focus.', '2004-07-05 11:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(796344, 88260, 14656, '<td valign="top">Overexposed. Would''ve cropped out sky above building as it''s unnecessary. Other than meeting the purple challenge, what makes this an interesting photo?</td>', 'Overexposed. Would''ve cropped out sky above building as it''s unnecessary. Other than meeting the purple challenge, what makes this an interesting photo?', '2004-07-05 12:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
