(796347, 86802, 14656, '<td valign="top">Either the shelf is warped or that''s barrel distortion. Nice idea but image is a little too busy. If you could eliminate some of the unnecessary elements and zero more in on the "purpleness", your composition would''ve been stronger.</td>', 'Either the shelf is warped or that''s barrel distortion. Nice idea but image is a little too busy. If you could eliminate some of the unnecessary elements and zero more in on the "purpleness", your composition would''ve been stronger.', '2004-07-05 12:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
