(796594, 87781, 20779, '<td valign="top">This is pure blue on my monitor, but I gave a high score anyway (still hints at purple at the very least, or just the difference in monitors!). The focus is so crisp and beautiful and just a great shot overall!!! Would make an awesome print.</td>', 'This is pure blue on my monitor, but I gave a high score anyway (still hints at purple at the very least, or just the difference in monitors!). The focus is so crisp and beautiful and just a great shot overall!!! Would make an awesome print.', '2004-07-05 14:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(796602, 88038, 7322, '<td valign="top">This looks blue on my monitor. Sorry. Even so,it''s kind of a dull composition. The planter has potential as interesting subject matter but I would have cropped out the unnattractive foliage, the wood, and the grass in the background. None of these elements add to the composition. The whole thing looks rather drab and colorless.</td>', 'This looks blue on my monitor. Sorry. Even so,it''s kind of a dull composition. The planter has potential as interesting subject matter but I would have cropped out the unnattractive foliage, the wood, and the grass in the background. None of these elements add to the composition. The whole thing looks rather drab and colorless.', '2004-07-05 14:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(796604, 88249, 7322, '<td valign="top">I see some purple in the sky but I don''t know if it impacts the photo as much as it should for this challenge. It''s a very nice night shot. I would only suggest cropping it to exclude the other wall or fence and the fishing gear.</td>', 'I see some purple in the sky but I don''t know if it impacts the photo as much as it should for this challenge. It''s a very nice night shot. I would only suggest cropping it to exclude the other wall or fence and the fishing gear.', '2004-07-05 14:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(796605, 88377, 7322, '<td valign="top">This looks like turquoise and vermillion to me. I''m not seeing much purple. It''s kind of unpleasant to look at.</td>', 'This looks like turquoise and vermillion to me. I''m not seeing much purple. It''s kind of unpleasant to look at.', '2004-07-05 14:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(796608, 88298, 16301, '<td valign="top">Julia?<br/> <br/>Excellent as always, 10. Good luck...</td>', 'Julia? Excellent as always, 10. Good luck...', '2004-07-05 14:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(796609, 88325, 7322, '<td valign="top">Was this done in camera with a filter? If it was done in PS it seems rather against the spirit of the challenge. Anyone can turn something purple in PS. <br/>Photographically, I''m not sure how much the addition of purple adds to this shot. The brownish don''t make a particulalry dynamic background. A closer crop might be more striking.</td>', 'Was this done in camera with a filter? If it was done in PS it seems rather against the spirit of the challenge. Anyone can turn something purple in PS. Photographically, I''m not sure how much the addition of purple adds to this shot. The brownish don''t make a particulalry dynamic background. A closer crop might be more striking.', '2004-07-05 14:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(796611, 88394, 7322, '<td valign="top">The color is very washed out due to harsh lighting and overexposure. I see some purple in the buds but I get more of a sense of blue from the flowers.</td>', 'The color is very washed out due to harsh lighting and overexposure. I see some purple in the buds but I get more of a sense of blue from the flowers.', '2004-07-05 14:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(796612, 87095, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is too small to get an idea of the quality.</td>', 'This is too small to get an idea of the quality.', '2004-07-05 14:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(796614, 88321, 7322, '<td valign="top">I tried this but wasn''t satisfied with my results. :-D  I think more of the leaf should be in focus to really capture the interesting texture and color gradiations. This is an awfully stingy crop.</td>', 'I tried this but wasn''t satisfied with my results. :-D  I think more of the leaf should be in focus to really capture the interesting texture and color gradiations. This is an awfully stingy crop.', '2004-07-05 14:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(796615, 88366, 7322, '<td valign="top">Cute model, cute expression. A bit high key but that doesn''t seem to be a problem here.</td>', 'Cute model, cute expression. A bit high key but that doesn''t seem to be a problem here.', '2004-07-05 14:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(796618, 86464, 7322, '<td valign="top">It could be a bit more dynamic in tonal range. Although I understand why you titled it this way, because of the rather bland color range, this photo doesn''t really suggest fireworks to me. Good subject and the centering works well.</td>', 'It could be a bit more dynamic in tonal range. Although I understand why you titled it this way, because of the rather bland color range, this photo doesn''t really suggest fireworks to me. Good subject and the centering works well.', '2004-07-05 14:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(796622, 88090, 7322, '<td valign="top">The tree in the background really hurts this. The two buds below the flower don''t add much, either. It''s a really good capture of the color and translucency of the flower.</td>', 'The tree in the background really hurts this. The two buds below the flower don''t add much, either. It''s a really good capture of the color and translucency of the flower.', '2004-07-05 14:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(796625, 88461, 7322, '<td valign="top">That chunky three-tiered border is really ugly and overwhelms a decent flower shot.</td>', 'That chunky three-tiered border is really ugly and overwhelms a decent flower shot.', '2004-07-05 14:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(796627, 88541, 7322, '<td valign="top">There''s a bit too much high key white in the background. It overwhelms the flower.</td>', 'There''s a bit too much high key white in the background. It overwhelms the flower.', '2004-07-05 14:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(796629, 88417, 7322, '<td valign="top">I had this idea but wasn''t satisified with my results. This is quite good. Very good use of negative space.</td>', 'I had this idea but wasn''t satisified with my results. This is quite good. Very good use of negative space.', '2004-07-05 15:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(796635, 86420, 7322, '<td valign="top">You should have cropped some off the top to eliminate the distracting triangle of blown out sky and some of the glare from the windows. Otherwise, it''s a nice POV and capture of the delicacy of the flower. I can''t decide whether I like the silouhette of the spider or not.</td>', 'You should have cropped some off the top to eliminate the distracting triangle of blown out sky and some of the glare from the windows. Otherwise, it''s a nice POV and capture of the delicacy of the flower. I can''t decide whether I like the silouhette of the spider or not.', '2004-07-05 15:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(796637, 88611, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is nteresting. It looks red on my monitor.</td>', 'This is nteresting. It looks red on my monitor.', '2004-07-05 15:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(796639, 88529, 7322, '<td valign="top">The chunky black border overwhelms the photo.</td>', 'The chunky black border overwhelms the photo.', '2004-07-05 15:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(796642, 88007, 12160, '<td valign="top">I like the splash and the different shades of purple on the glass. Works well against a white background.</td>', 'I like the splash and the different shades of purple on the glass. Works well against a white background.', '2004-07-05 15:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(796645, 88569, 7322, '<td valign="top">I''m not seeing any suggestion of purple. I see bronze, aqua, blue, yellow, gold,cream, beige even a bit of red in the background but absolutely no purple. <br/> <br/>It''s a nice snap shot but the background is a bit distracting.</td>', 'I''m not seeing any suggestion of purple. I see bronze, aqua, blue, yellow, gold,cream, beige even a bit of red in the background but absolutely no purple.  It''s a nice snap shot but the background is a bit distracting.', '2004-07-05 15:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(796650, 87685, 7322, '<td valign="top">Where''s the lipstick? <br/> <br/>This is kind of boring. The lighting is rather flat. There''s very little drama. The fussy white doily ruins any suggestion of sexiness.</td>', 'Where''s the lipstick?  This is kind of boring. The lighting is rather flat. There''s very little drama. The fussy white doily ruins any suggestion of sexiness.', '2004-07-05 15:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(796654, 88349, 7322, '<td valign="top">There is too much going on here. The plant, the texture of the floor, the stamps and caligraphy on the screen all distract the eye from the kimono.</td>', 'There is too much going on here. The plant, the texture of the floor, the stamps and caligraphy on the screen all distract the eye from the kimono.', '2004-07-05 15:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(796656, 88584, 7322, '<td valign="top">Really nice shot. Interesting POV and nice simple lines. I''m not really getting a suggestion of purple on my monitor. The flowers look blue to me.</td>', 'Really nice shot. Interesting POV and nice simple lines. I''m not really getting a suggestion of purple on my monitor. The flowers look blue to me.', '2004-07-05 15:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
