(796659, 88324, 7322, '<td valign="top">It is purple but this modern brick building is a very boring subject. The ceiling is interesting but it is out of focus. I suggest a tripod for night shots in the future.</td>', 'It is purple but this modern brick building is a very boring subject. The ceiling is interesting but it is out of focus. I suggest a tripod for night shots in the future.', '2004-07-05 15:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
