(796773, 88214, 22781, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen this shot twice.<br/>I don''t care that it is done before BUT, i can tell you that the other 2 are better.<br/>1st the "table" is distracting<br/>2nd you have some "glare" on the glass<br/>3th The colors reflected true the water are more bright then the colors of the "paper"<br/>4th I know when you mix up red and blue that you get purple, but I dont see purple.<br/>The challenge said show or suggest the color purple, so you meet the challenge, I like the shot but I also like to talk inteligent :) 7</td>', 'I''ve seen this shot twice.I don''t care that it is done before BUT, i can tell you that the other 2 are better.1st the "table" is distracting2nd you have some "glare" on the glass3th The colors reflected true the water are more bright then the colors of the "paper"4th I know when you mix up red and blue that you get purple, but I dont see purple.The challenge said show or suggest the color purple, so you meet the challenge, I like the shot but I also like to talk inteligent :) 7', '2004-07-05 16:43:25.000000', NULL, 1);
