(797555, 88307, 15891, '<td valign="top">Just my opinion but I think for photos like this, the lighting needs to be really dramatic in order to transform a mundane subject into an attractive image.</td>', 'Just my opinion but I think for photos like this, the lighting needs to be really dramatic in order to transform a mundane subject into an attractive image.', '2004-07-06 10:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(797559, 88573, 15891, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition of this photo and the shallow DOF really adds a dreamy quality to this image. To make it really stand out, you might try a little dodging on the forefront flower - or perhaps you could have employed a flash to highlight your main subject?</td>', 'I really like the composition of this photo and the shallow DOF really adds a dreamy quality to this image. To make it really stand out, you might try a little dodging on the forefront flower - or perhaps you could have employed a flash to highlight your main subject?', '2004-07-06 10:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(797561, 88038, 15891, '<td valign="top">I''ll admit that variances in computer monitors might be the problem here but I see nothing purple in this photo.</td>', 'I''ll admit that variances in computer monitors might be the problem here but I see nothing purple in this photo.', '2004-07-06 10:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(797566, 88375, 15891, '<td valign="top">This is a very creative idea. I think the image would benefit from the subject being in sharper focus. Also you might have metered off the dark background as your subject looks a little dark. Or a flash might have helped. Post processing might have included some dodging to lighten up the crystals in the front.</td>', 'This is a very creative idea. I think the image would benefit from the subject being in sharper focus. Also you might have metered off the dark background as your subject looks a little dark. Or a flash might have helped. Post processing might have included some dodging to lighten up the crystals in the front.', '2004-07-06 10:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(797570, 88615, 15891, '<td valign="top">Monitors could be at fault but I think the flowers look more blue than purple. Also, I think some additional lighting on the front flower would help as well as some overall sharpening.</td>', 'Monitors could be at fault but I think the flowers look more blue than purple. Also, I think some additional lighting on the front flower would help as well as some overall sharpening.', '2004-07-06 10:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(797575, 88610, 15891, '<td valign="top">I think this image would benefit from softer lighting - the shadows seem harsh to me.</td>', 'I think this image would benefit from softer lighting - the shadows seem harsh to me.', '2004-07-06 10:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(797576, 88260, 15891, '<td valign="top">Without benefit of the title I had a hard time determining the subject of this photo. Maybe a tighter focus on your subject would have helped?</td>', 'Without benefit of the title I had a hard time determining the subject of this photo. Maybe a tighter focus on your subject would have helped?', '2004-07-06 10:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
