(797580, 88422, 15891, '<td valign="top">I like the surreal quality of this image and the contrast of the purple flower against the dreamy green background. The weeds (?) in the front are distracting though... Could you have pushed them out of the way?</td>', 'I like the surreal quality of this image and the contrast of the purple flower against the dreamy green background. The weeds (?) in the front are distracting though... Could you have pushed them out of the way?', '2004-07-06 10:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
