(798456, 88619, 22385, '<td valign="top">Very simple photo, yet it is quite mesmerizing!  I like the way the purple meshes with the silver/clear glass(?)!  What exactly is this star reflecting?  This photo is a 9 in my book!</td>', 'Very simple photo, yet it is quite mesmerizing!  I like the way the purple meshes with the silver/clear glass(?)!  What exactly is this star reflecting?  This photo is a 9 in my book!', '2004-07-06 20:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
