(798486, 86464, 22385, '<td valign="top">I saw the text before the photo and had a brief moment where I thought, "Not more fireworks!"  But the photo of a flower surprised me.  That may be pushing my rating for the photo higher - I''m not sure.  But it is a beautiful photo, nonetheless.  I would give it a 7.</td>', 'I saw the text before the photo and had a brief moment where I thought, "Not more fireworks!"  But the photo of a flower surprised me.  That may be pushing my rating for the photo higher - I''m not sure.  But it is a beautiful photo, nonetheless.  I would give it a 7.', '2004-07-06 20:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(798487, 88580, 22385, '<td valign="top">I LOVE this photo!  It is exceptionally simple yet beauitful.  I like the contrast between the purple starfish and the sand.  My only gripe is the bottom of the starfish seems a touch out of focus.  This is a top contender, I think!  9!</td>', 'I LOVE this photo!  It is exceptionally simple yet beauitful.  I like the contrast between the purple starfish and the sand.  My only gripe is the bottom of the starfish seems a touch out of focus.  This is a top contender, I think!  9!', '2004-07-06 20:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(798490, 88325, 22385, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... is that fly really purple?  The coloring in this photo seem fake to me, so it doesn''t do the photo much justice.  I truly love the blue highlights in the flower, but the purple elsewhere is unappealing to me.  Would have been better for another challenge without the purple (in my opinion).</td>', 'Hmmm... is that fly really purple?  The coloring in this photo seem fake to me, so it doesn''t do the photo much justice.  I truly love the blue highlights in the flower, but the purple elsewhere is unappealing to me.  Would have been better for another challenge without the purple (in my opinion).', '2004-07-06 20:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(798494, 88525, 22385, '<td valign="top">I like this photo... it is very soothing.  The sunset is captivating, but it is the figure of the boy that puts the power in this photo.  My only complaint might be the line near the top right... not sure what it is, but it takes away from the photo.   I would give this photo a 9 overall!</td>', 'I like this photo... it is very soothing.  The sunset is captivating, but it is the figure of the boy that puts the power in this photo.  My only complaint might be the line near the top right... not sure what it is, but it takes away from the photo.   I would give this photo a 9 overall!', '2004-07-06 20:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
