(802014, 88306, 23300, '<td valign="top">I know how hard it is to get this kind of shot right. This is well executed. The purple really suits the subject.</td>', 'I know how hard it is to get this kind of shot right. This is well executed. The purple really suits the subject.', '2004-07-08 07:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(802017, 88414, 23300, '<td valign="top">I think the shirt works well against the green background. Its prominent without being too loud. I personally would have cropped this with a bit more space above the subjects head. The lighting in this photo is strikingly clear.</td>', 'I think the shirt works well against the green background. Its prominent without being too loud. I personally would have cropped this with a bit more space above the subjects head. The lighting in this photo is strikingly clear.', '2004-07-08 07:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(802021, 88390, 23300, '<td valign="top">I think this photo really captures the intended emotion. I really like it when people have a go at pushing some of the technical conventions a bit. I think the overexposed look works really well with the colour and subjet matter. The grainy texture in the mid tones also adds to the emotional impact.</td>', 'I think this photo really captures the intended emotion. I really like it when people have a go at pushing some of the technical conventions a bit. I think the overexposed look works really well with the colour and subjet matter. The grainy texture in the mid tones also adds to the emotional impact.', '2004-07-08 07:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(802023, 86610, 23300, '<td valign="top">The depth of field is effective and the lighting is well balanced.</td>', 'The depth of field is effective and the lighting is well balanced.', '2004-07-08 07:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(802027, 88194, 23300, '<td valign="top">This image has more impact than most of these types of shots that I''ve seen. The colour of the flower really adds drama to the bees activity. The bee looks almost sinister against the delicate flower. The depth of field is spot on to put the attention where the action is.</td>', 'This image has more impact than most of these types of shots that I''ve seen. The colour of the flower really adds drama to the bees activity. The bee looks almost sinister against the delicate flower. The depth of field is spot on to put the attention where the action is.', '2004-07-08 07:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(802030, 87681, 23300, '<td valign="top">I like the starkness of the subject against the background. Unfortunately I can''t work out what the subject is and it doesn''t really grab me as an abstract.</td>', 'I like the starkness of the subject against the background. Unfortunately I can''t work out what the subject is and it doesn''t really grab me as an abstract.', '2004-07-08 07:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(802033, 86802, 23300, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of subject matter. I think a border would help to define this image better. Also the flash glare near the top detracts from the image</td>', 'Interesting choice of subject matter. I think a border would help to define this image better. Also the flash glare near the top detracts from the image', '2004-07-08 07:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(802037, 88612, 23300, '<td valign="top">I really like the green against the purple. Actually I like the red against the purple too. Not sure about the composition. It feels upside down, if that makes sense. I don''t think just rotating it would reverse that. I think I would have tried some other compositions.</td>', 'I really like the green against the purple. Actually I like the red against the purple too. Not sure about the composition. It feels upside down, if that makes sense. I don''t think just rotating it would reverse that. I think I would have tried some other compositions.', '2004-07-08 07:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(802042, 88352, 23300, '<td valign="top">Great depth of field work. I love the light of this image. There''s a sort of mysterious mood about it. The composition does seem to lack a focal point though. I feel that my eye is searching for a place to rest.</td>', 'Great depth of field work. I love the light of this image. There''s a sort of mysterious mood about it. The composition does seem to lack a focal point though. I feel that my eye is searching for a place to rest.', '2004-07-08 07:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(802043, 86513, 23300, '<td valign="top">The colour is certainly vibrant. The dark area around the top really pushes the subject forward.</td>', 'The colour is certainly vibrant. The dark area around the top really pushes the subject forward.', '2004-07-08 07:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(802054, 86640, 23300, '<td valign="top">This shot is interesting. Well done for having a go at something a little different. I can see the effort in setting the lighting up. At first it feels a bit hard on the eye but the more I look at it the more I''m drawn to the centreline of the subjects face. The image seems to split my perception if I stare at it. Not the most comfortable experience but interesting and challenging. In the end the subject''s eyes start to draw the focus. Thanks for the challenge to my perception.</td>', 'This shot is interesting. Well done for having a go at something a little different. I can see the effort in setting the lighting up. At first it feels a bit hard on the eye but the more I look at it the more I''m drawn to the centreline of the subjects face. The image seems to split my perception if I stare at it. Not the most comfortable experience but interesting and challenging. In the end the subject''s eyes start to draw the focus. Thanks for the challenge to my perception.', '2004-07-08 07:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(802057, 86762, 23300, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful example of what I would call a "classic" flower shot. Wonderful depth of field a light. I think you have made this flower look better than it did in real life.</td>', 'This is a beautiful example of what I would call a "classic" flower shot. Wonderful depth of field a light. I think you have made this flower look better than it did in real life.', '2004-07-08 07:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(802065, 88575, 23300, '<td valign="top">I really like the starkness of this shot. The crispness of the edges is quite dramatic. The little white specs do detract from the crispness of the colour. A little bit of cloning would make a huge difference to this shot. Great shot all the same.</td>', 'I really like the starkness of this shot. The crispness of the edges is quite dramatic. The little white specs do detract from the crispness of the colour. A little bit of cloning would make a huge difference to this shot. Great shot all the same.', '2004-07-08 08:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(802069, 87818, 23300, '<td valign="top">I love this shot. The balance of depth of field, texture, colour and lighting are all awesome. The flower takes on an almost alien nature. The only thing I would add would be a bit more space around the subject. Well Done.</td>', 'I love this shot. The balance of depth of field, texture, colour and lighting are all awesome. The flower takes on an almost alien nature. The only thing I would add would be a bit more space around the subject. Well Done.', '2004-07-08 08:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(802070, 88431, 23300, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Simple but elegant composition.</td>', 'Beautiful. Simple but elegant composition.', '2004-07-08 08:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(802072, 88094, 23300, '<td valign="top">I love the lack of shadows. The starkness is beautiful. This shot portrays your expertise at this type of shot. I would only suggest a little more white space around the subject.</td>', 'I love the lack of shadows. The starkness is beautiful. This shot portrays your expertise at this type of shot. I would only suggest a little more white space around the subject.', '2004-07-08 08:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(802075, 88131, 23300, '<td valign="top">I like the cropping. This is not your average fireworks shot with streaming umbrella like tails. I think it really works. The mixture of colour and textures really give life to the image.</td>', 'I like the cropping. This is not your average fireworks shot with streaming umbrella like tails. I think it really works. The mixture of colour and textures really give life to the image.', '2004-07-08 08:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(802079, 88572, 23300, '<td valign="top">Awesome. This is beautiful. The composition is daring and striking. The depth of field is superb. The colour and lighting are gorgeous. You''ve enhanced the subject to the extreme. To me this is a winner.</td>', 'Awesome. This is beautiful. The composition is daring and striking. The depth of field is superb. The colour and lighting are gorgeous. You''ve enhanced the subject to the extreme. To me this is a winner.', '2004-07-08 08:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(802081, 88067, 23300, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful. Its a textural experience for the eyes. Its a joy to absorb. There are what look like colour artifacts in the shadows that can tend to detract a little from the depth of the picture. Apart from that the composition and colour are very striking.</td>', 'This is beautiful. Its a textural experience for the eyes. Its a joy to absorb. There are what look like colour artifacts in the shadows that can tend to detract a little from the depth of the picture. Apart from that the composition and colour are very striking.', '2004-07-08 08:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(802083, 88374, 23300, '<td valign="top">The composition is quite compelling. The bit of light in the top right corner, on the mask just tends to draw the eye a little. Maybe some sort of difussion technique might have softened this. The shot certainly has impact though.</td>', 'The composition is quite compelling. The bit of light in the top right corner, on the mask just tends to draw the eye a little. Maybe some sort of difussion technique might have softened this. The shot certainly has impact though.', '2004-07-08 08:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(802085, 86464, 23300, '<td valign="top">The colours really work well together. The depth of field is quite dramatic. I think the central positioning was a good choice. I also think the title is quite effective.</td>', 'The colours really work well together. The depth of field is quite dramatic. I think the central positioning was a good choice. I also think the title is quite effective.', '2004-07-08 08:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(802087, 86712, 23300, '<td valign="top">I really like this. Its very striking. The contrast between the texture and the smooth surface is really pleasing.</td>', 'I really like this. Its very striking. The contrast between the texture and the smooth surface is really pleasing.', '2004-07-08 08:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(802090, 88317, 23300, '<td valign="top">The smoke is quite dramatic and the colour is very beautiful and stark. The desaturation works really well to enhance the texture and colour of the smoke.</td>', 'The smoke is quite dramatic and the colour is very beautiful and stark. The desaturation works really well to enhance the texture and colour of the smoke.', '2004-07-08 08:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(802092, 88090, 23300, '<td valign="top">I like the way the background lifts the flower. The low angle works really well. This picture gives an uplifting feeling.</td>', 'I like the way the background lifts the flower. The low angle works really well. This picture gives an uplifting feeling.', '2004-07-08 08:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(802095, 88467, 23300, '<td valign="top">Great composition and lighting. Great cropping too.</td>', 'Great composition and lighting. Great cropping too.', '2004-07-08 08:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(802100, 88261, 23300, '<td valign="top">I don''t see the purple. Having said that, this is a great shot. I love the colours, the composition and the soft focus. It portrays an almost hypnotic uneasiness. I love it.<br/>(Maybe the petals are purple and it did not come through in the photo)</td>', 'I don''t see the purple. Having said that, this is a great shot. I love the colours, the composition and the soft focus. It portrays an almost hypnotic uneasiness. I love it.(Maybe the petals are purple and it did not come through in the photo)', '2004-07-08 08:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(802102, 88297, 23300, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the fireworks. It just doesn''t really leap out against other shots of fireworks.</td>', 'Nice capture of the fireworks. It just doesn''t really leap out against other shots of fireworks.', '2004-07-08 08:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(802103, 88338, 23300, '<td valign="top">This is a very appealling shot. To me the texture in the top half of the image is the most striking part of this shot. The contrasting textures work really well together and the light is quite dramatic. I would love to know how you went about taking this shot.</td>', 'This is a very appealling shot. To me the texture in the top half of the image is the most striking part of this shot. The contrasting textures work really well together and the light is quite dramatic. I would love to know how you went about taking this shot.', '2004-07-08 08:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(802106, 88576, 23300, '<td valign="top">This is a really well executed shot. It stands out from the crowd of fireworks photos. The composition really makes this shot what it is. The varying textures are all in beautiful balance.</td>', 'This is a really well executed shot. It stands out from the crowd of fireworks photos. The composition really makes this shot what it is. The varying textures are all in beautiful balance.', '2004-07-08 08:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(802107, 87016, 23300, '<td valign="top">This image is really appealling. The random balance of the weaving is quite well proportioned. The dark and light areas are also well balanced.</td>', 'This image is really appealling. The random balance of the weaving is quite well proportioned. The dark and light areas are also well balanced.', '2004-07-08 08:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(802108, 88618, 23300, '<td valign="top">This is a really striking image. The depth of field is perfect. The lighting is perfect and the composition is beautiful.</td>', 'This is a really striking image. The depth of field is perfect. The lighting is perfect and the composition is beautiful.', '2004-07-08 08:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(802110, 87632, 23300, '<td valign="top">The colours work well together. The depth of field works well. The composition really pushes the subject matter forward adding a bit of drama to a fairly simple subject.</td>', 'The colours work well together. The depth of field works well. The composition really pushes the subject matter forward adding a bit of drama to a fairly simple subject.', '2004-07-08 08:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
