(802114, 88614, 23300, '<td valign="top">The composition helps to create some impact from the subject matter, enhancing the horizontal direction of the textures. I don''t think it quite does enough though. I personally feel that if the toes had been cropped out then the image would take on a more abstract character leaving the focus more on the thextures.</td>', 'The composition helps to create some impact from the subject matter, enhancing the horizontal direction of the textures. I don''t think it quite does enough though. I personally feel that if the toes had been cropped out then the image would take on a more abstract character leaving the focus more on the thextures.', '2004-07-08 08:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(802117, 87305, 23300, '<td valign="top">Wow. Beautiful misty feeling about this image. Well done for spotting the scene in the first place. The depth of field works really well. The lighting and colours are awesome.</td>', 'Wow. Beautiful misty feeling about this image. Well done for spotting the scene in the first place. The depth of field works really well. The lighting and colours are awesome.', '2004-07-08 08:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(802120, 87095, 23300, '<td valign="top">I think the central positioning works for this image. I like the way that the background is divided diagonally between the leaves and the wood. The colours in this image all compliment each other well.</td>', 'I think the central positioning works for this image. I like the way that the background is divided diagonally between the leaves and the wood. The colours in this image all compliment each other well.', '2004-07-08 09:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(802128, 87685, 23300, '<td valign="top">The lighting works really well for this image. Its soft and warm. My only suggestion would be that perhaps the lamp makes the image a little cluttered. I would have tried putting the glasses nearer where the lamp is and removed the lamp. Just a suggestion.</td>', 'The lighting works really well for this image. Its soft and warm. My only suggestion would be that perhaps the lamp makes the image a little cluttered. I would have tried putting the glasses nearer where the lamp is and removed the lamp. Just a suggestion.', '2004-07-08 09:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(802129, 87649, 23300, '<td valign="top">I think the composition really pushes the purple. I think having it a bit more squared up would enhance the image. Especially if the horizontal lines of the box were parallel to the bottom of the photo. Perhaps also a little bit more space at the top of the image and a border would help to enhance the subject.</td>', 'I think the composition really pushes the purple. I think having it a bit more squared up would enhance the image. Especially if the horizontal lines of the box were parallel to the bottom of the photo. Perhaps also a little bit more space at the top of the image and a border would help to enhance the subject.', '2004-07-08 09:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
