(803427, 88573, 19608, '<td valign="top">A very unique image with some great purple.  The orange is so overpowering - it competes with the flower.  Compositionally - the other purple shapes on the bottom right and the bottom - just left of center - should not be there.  Whte line in the border detracts.</td>', 'A very unique image with some great purple.  The orange is so overpowering - it competes with the flower.  Compositionally - the other purple shapes on the bottom right and the bottom - just left of center - should not be there.  Whte line in the border detracts.', '2004-07-09 03:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(803429, 88357, 19608, '<td valign="top">It''ssharp, interesting and purple. IMHO - the scalloped leaf on the left competes with your vein patterns in the main leaf.</td>', 'It''ssharp, interesting and purple. IMHO - the scalloped leaf on the left competes with your vein patterns in the main leaf.', '2004-07-09 03:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(803431, 88497, 19608, '<td valign="top">Some very nice purples - but in a rather haphazard composition. The background is very nicely blurred to prevent any distractions.</td>', 'Some very nice purples - but in a rather haphazard composition. The background is very nicely blurred to prevent any distractions.', '2004-07-09 03:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(803433, 87649, 19608, '<td valign="top">You are right about that - the ROYAL purple.   You have a great idea - but consider:<br/> <br/>The left side - with the vertical lines in the wall - is detracting.<br/>The highlights on the boxes hinge is also a distraction.<br/> <br/>t would probably be more effective if the glass was level.</td>', 'You are right about that - the ROYAL purple.   You have a great idea - but consider: The left side - with the vertical lines in the wall - is detracting.The highlights on the boxes hinge is also a distraction. t would probably be more effective if the glass was level.', '2004-07-09 03:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(803435, 88307, 19608, '<td valign="top">It is definitely a purple bench - but the green grass in combination make it garish for me.</td>', 'It is definitely a purple bench - but the green grass in combination make it garish for me.', '2004-07-09 03:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(803436, 87685, 19608, '<td valign="top">Looks like satin sheets at that!  Nice inea and image - a bit of mystery / intrigue.</td>', 'Looks like satin sheets at that!  Nice inea and image - a bit of mystery / intrigue.', '2004-07-09 03:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(803437, 87016, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract and loads of purple.</td>', 'Nice abstract and loads of purple.', '2004-07-09 03:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
