(803465, 88032, 23300, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition of this image. The lighting is also well done. Just enough to get the tonal gradations in the paint looking right.</td>', 'I really like the composition of this image. The lighting is also well done. Just enough to get the tonal gradations in the paint looking right.', '2004-07-09 04:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(803469, 87237, 23300, '<td valign="top">I think the purple and green work really well together. I do find the central postion and the scale of the flower a bit "loud." Perhaps the flower could have been positioned a bit to one side and maybe been a bit smaller. Just a suggestion.</td>', 'I think the purple and green work really well together. I do find the central postion and the scale of the flower a bit "loud." Perhaps the flower could have been positioned a bit to one side and maybe been a bit smaller. Just a suggestion.', '2004-07-09 04:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(803470, 88369, 23300, '<td valign="top">Love the colour contrast between the flower and the background. The composition is also powerful. It adds a bit of dynamics to the image. The depth of field works really well here too.</td>', 'Love the colour contrast between the flower and the background. The composition is also powerful. It adds a bit of dynamics to the image. The depth of field works really well here too.', '2004-07-09 04:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(803471, 88324, 23300, '<td valign="top">Interesting compostion. The colours work well and the curves across the top are quite dynamic. The image does seem a little out of focus.</td>', 'Interesting compostion. The colours work well and the curves across the top are quite dynamic. The image does seem a little out of focus.', '2004-07-09 04:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(803472, 88249, 23300, '<td valign="top">Lovely concept. The colours are very subtle. I feel that the light takes too much of my attention. I think this image would even work with the lights cropped out. You could crop to just outside the mans back and crop most of the top off to the height of the fence at the right of the image This would make the light on the man''s back the brightest part of the image. Just a suggestion.</td>', 'Lovely concept. The colours are very subtle. I feel that the light takes too much of my attention. I think this image would even work with the lights cropped out. You could crop to just outside the mans back and crop most of the top off to the height of the fence at the right of the image This would make the light on the man''s back the brightest part of the image. Just a suggestion.', '2004-07-09 04:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(803473, 88208, 23300, '<td valign="top">I really like this. The composition works really well. The focus does seem to be a bit out. Great shot though.</td>', 'I really like this. The composition works really well. The focus does seem to be a bit out. Great shot though.', '2004-07-09 04:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(803475, 88357, 23300, '<td valign="top">I love the composition and the mood that this image creates. The focus seems a bit soft. Is this intentional? I wonder if sharper focus would really push out the texture.</td>', 'I love the composition and the mood that this image creates. The focus seems a bit soft. Is this intentional? I wonder if sharper focus would really push out the texture.', '2004-07-09 04:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(803476, 88058, 23300, '<td valign="top">I like the starkness of this image. The composition works well.</td>', 'I like the starkness of this image. The composition works well.', '2004-07-09 04:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(803477, 88409, 23300, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the stark light. The bright foreground and soft background really push the subjects forward. I wonder if a wide depth of field would work better to give focus to all the cars.</td>', 'I like the composition and the stark light. The bright foreground and soft background really push the subjects forward. I wonder if a wide depth of field would work better to give focus to all the cars.', '2004-07-09 04:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(803479, 86547, 23300, '<td valign="top">I like the random nature of the subject matter. The woman sitting in the bed in the picture somehow seems to echo the big pillow or cusion. It almost makes me want to imagine there is someone sitting on the cushion to finish off the scene. This makes the image surprisingly engaging. I think a border would add heaps to this image. A border would almost act as a "window" through which to observe the scene. The focus is a bit soft but a nice sharp border might contrast with that quite well.</td>', 'I like the random nature of the subject matter. The woman sitting in the bed in the picture somehow seems to echo the big pillow or cusion. It almost makes me want to imagine there is someone sitting on the cushion to finish off the scene. This makes the image surprisingly engaging. I think a border would add heaps to this image. A border would almost act as a "window" through which to observe the scene. The focus is a bit soft but a nice sharp border might contrast with that quite well.', '2004-07-09 04:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(803485, 86980, 23300, '<td valign="top">The purple light and soft focus give the model an almost porcelin look. The mood works well. I do find that my eye doesn''t quite know where to settle on this image.<br/>Her face, earing, ring and bottle all grab my attention. As well as the highlight on her neck. Perhaps more empty space above and to the right of the model would pull all these elements together into one part of the picture rather than them being spread throughout it. Its still a really nice shot though.</td>', 'The purple light and soft focus give the model an almost porcelin look. The mood works well. I do find that my eye doesn''t quite know where to settle on this image.Her face, earing, ring and bottle all grab my attention. As well as the highlight on her neck. Perhaps more empty space above and to the right of the model would pull all these elements together into one part of the picture rather than them being spread throughout it. Its still a really nice shot though.', '2004-07-09 04:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(803487, 87629, 23300, '<td valign="top">I think this works really well. The lighting and background complement each other and the composition really enhances the powerful expression.</td>', 'I think this works really well. The lighting and background complement each other and the composition really enhances the powerful expression.', '2004-07-09 04:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(803488, 88366, 23300, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful image. The lighting is ideal the depth of field is awesome. The Background works really well. The cropping and composition really enhance the subject. This is a top scorer for me.</td>', 'This is a beautiful image. The lighting is ideal the depth of field is awesome. The Background works really well. The cropping and composition really enhance the subject. This is a top scorer for me.', '2004-07-09 04:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(803489, 88170, 23300, '<td valign="top">This is really well done. The composition is great and the subject matter works really well for this effect.</td>', 'This is really well done. The composition is great and the subject matter works really well for this effect.', '2004-07-09 04:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(803490, 86406, 23300, '<td valign="top">I think this works really well. The lighting is perfect. The composition is ideal. This is one of the few times where I think not using a border is a good idea.</td>', 'I think this works really well. The lighting is perfect. The composition is ideal. This is one of the few times where I think not using a border is a good idea.', '2004-07-09 04:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
