(803494, 87157, 23300, '<td valign="top">This is really creepy. I assume that was your aim. I''m curious how you created the lighting effects on his body. The lighting and composition work really well together. I think this is a really well executed shot.</td>', 'This is really creepy. I assume that was your aim. I''m curious how you created the lighting effects on his body. The lighting and composition work really well together. I think this is a really well executed shot.', '2004-07-09 04:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
