(804031, 88467, 4049, '<td valign="top">I like your idea &amp; choice of subject, I maybe would have left out the samples on the bottom. also, I''m just not "moved" by the layout in general of the samples... maybe a closer view or a more dramatic angle, playing w/ the focus... something just to make the image unique and different.</td>', 'I like your idea & choice of subject, I maybe would have left out the samples on the bottom. also, I''m just not "moved" by the layout in general of the samples... maybe a closer view or a more dramatic angle, playing w/ the focus... something just to make the image unique and different.', '2004-07-09 16:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(804032, 86416, 6073, '<td valign="top">The lighting seems a bit off or weak.  I def think this was a great idea, but the white on white doesn''t show up well.</td>', 'The lighting seems a bit off or weak.  I def think this was a great idea, but the white on white doesn''t show up well.', '2004-07-09 16:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
