(804103, 88617, 9668, '<td valign="top">Background is noisy.  I like the 3 colors in it, they work well together and makes the purple stand out. Good DOF, but image seems a bit out of focus.</td>', 'Background is noisy.  I like the 3 colors in it, they work well together and makes the purple stand out. Good DOF, but image seems a bit out of focus.', '2004-07-09 17:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
