(804295, 86579, 17562, '<td valign="top">very nice</td>', 'very nice', '2004-07-09 21:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(804297, 87683, 17562, '<td valign="top">great colours</td>', 'great colours', '2004-07-09 21:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(804393, 88067, 19608, '<td valign="top">Your colors are nice - the idea is unique.  It doesn''t have much of a message for me - probably due to the huge amount of bright area with no detail.</td>', 'Your colors are nice - the idea is unique.  It doesn''t have much of a message for me - probably due to the huge amount of bright area with no detail.', '2004-07-09 22:51:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(804398, 88398, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great colors and composition.  May be just a tiny bit hot - but that could easily be toned down if you decide to go with prints.</td>', 'Great colors and composition.  May be just a tiny bit hot - but that could easily be toned down if you decide to go with prints.', '2004-07-09 22:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(804401, 87668, 19608, '<td valign="top">The flower is great as is the shallow DoF to blur the background. Bug hitchhiker is a nice extra.  The border is unnecessary and especially the purple line.</td>', 'The flower is great as is the shallow DoF to blur the background. Bug hitchhiker is a nice extra.  The border is unnecessary and especially the purple line.', '2004-07-09 22:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(804403, 88566, 19608, '<td valign="top">Perfect colors and nice composition.  So far it''s been the best of the fireworks shots.</td>', 'Perfect colors and nice composition.  So far it''s been the best of the fireworks shots.', '2004-07-09 22:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(804404, 88021, 19608, '<td valign="top">Interestiing idea - and definitely purple.</td>', 'Interestiing idea - and definitely purple.', '2004-07-09 22:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(804409, 86980, 15403, '<td valign="top">excellent photo!  I like the fact that you took a "risk" in using a portrait, but it really paid off.  The lighting and tone are beautiful.  I''m not sure if the motion blur on the finger is intentional or not...how ''bout a 9?</td>', 'excellent photo!  I like the fact that you took a "risk" in using a portrait, but it really paid off.  The lighting and tone are beautiful.  I''m not sure if the motion blur on the finger is intentional or not...how ''bout a 9?', '2004-07-09 22:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(804412, 88350, 19608, '<td valign="top">Ah - this is a great capture of a very difficult shot.  Your selection of colors is superb.  The star flare on the top of the drop is a magical addition.  There are two things that may bring your score down a bit: a) It''s been done many time before (but this is one of the best I''ve seen.) and b) The border doesn''t help for me.  Great job....</td>', 'Ah - this is a great capture of a very difficult shot.  Your selection of colors is superb.  The star flare on the top of the drop is a magical addition.  There are two things that may bring your score down a bit: a) It''s been done many time before (but this is one of the best I''ve seen.) and b) The border doesn''t help for me.  Great job....', '2004-07-09 22:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(804414, 86640, 19608, '<td valign="top">It fits and is a nice two-light portrait.  Interesting colors and that''s quite a "side door" title.</td>', 'It fits and is a nice two-light portrait.  Interesting colors and that''s quite a "side door" title.', '2004-07-09 23:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(804419, 88617, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great colors - the purple works well aginst the blue.  Too bad the closet object is soft and that the bright area is between the two right "hotties."</td>', 'Great colors - the purple works well aginst the blue.  Too bad the closet object is soft and that the bright area is between the two right "hotties."', '2004-07-09 23:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(804421, 88264, 19608, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle - but effectice,  Grat colors and your exposure is right on.</td>', 'Interesting angle - but effectice,  Grat colors and your exposure is right on.', '2004-07-09 23:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(804425, 88383, 19608, '<td valign="top">Excellent colors and composition.  The black background really brings out the greens and of course, the purple.  Water is nice but doesn''t seem uniform.  White border is ok but not needed.</td>', 'Excellent colors and composition.  The black background really brings out the greens and of course, the purple.  Water is nice but doesn''t seem uniform.  White border is ok but not needed.', '2004-07-09 23:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(804427, 88133, 19608, '<td valign="top">Way cool.  Just the perfect amount of light on the face.   Composition is extremely effective. Teeth may be a bit too white, but I expect that is due to the dark areas in which they live.  I think I hear the ribbon train heading in your direction - listen for the whistle.</td>', 'Way cool.  Just the perfect amount of light on the face.   Composition is extremely effective. Teeth may be a bit too white, but I expect that is due to the dark areas in which they live.  I think I hear the ribbon train heading in your direction - listen for the whistle.', '2004-07-09 23:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(804429, 88411, 19608, '<td valign="top">This is a magical thistle with perfect DoF to blur the background and the repeating thistle pattern.  Exposure = PERFECT.  Composition on the diagonal is an excellent choice.</td>', 'This is a magical thistle with perfect DoF to blur the background and the repeating thistle pattern.  Exposure = PERFECT.  Composition on the diagonal is an excellent choice.', '2004-07-09 23:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(804430, 88576, 19608, '<td valign="top">An excellent rendition of fireworks - but I must say you are in a huge anmount of competition for that idea. This one is really nicely done.</td>', 'An excellent rendition of fireworks - but I must say you are in a huge anmount of competition for that idea. This one is really nicely done.', '2004-07-09 23:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(804436, 87520, 19608, '<td valign="top">The pills are definitely purple and in an interesting arrangement.    I like the DoF but don''t find much real interest.</td>', 'The pills are definitely purple and in an interesting arrangement.    I like the DoF but don''t find much real interest.', '2004-07-09 23:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
