(804600, 88130, 6630, '<td valign="top">OK, so I guess it meets the challenge but only because you manipulated it either with a purple filter or in an image editing software.  This is not a natural looking sunset becuse sunsets or sunrises do not naturaly look like this.  It feels to me that you made it this way just because the challenge was "Purple".  I don''t know if I''m explaning myself clearly, but, although I think this is  good photo overall, I think you tried to shoehorn it into the challenge. BTW, your horizon is tilted, this isn''t visually appealing.</td>', 'OK, so I guess it meets the challenge but only because you manipulated it either with a purple filter or in an image editing software.  This is not a natural looking sunset becuse sunsets or sunrises do not naturaly look like this.  It feels to me that you made it this way just because the challenge was "Purple".  I don''t know if I''m explaning myself clearly, but, although I think this is  good photo overall, I think you tried to shoehorn it into the challenge. BTW, your horizon is tilted, this isn''t visually appealing.', '2004-07-10 03:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
