(804946, 86980, 15407, '<td valign="top">You conveyed the mood (an attractive lady, seductively well dressed, the excellent capture of the spray of fragrance, the ring on her finger all convey the ''passion'' mentioned in your title.  The purple tones also enhance and add a seductive quality) &amp; purple, yet the model didn''t  ... after taking another look at your photo I wondered why the models expression didn''t have the same ''passion'' as the rest of the photo?  I''m thinking it may be the ''stance'' of her head to protect the lips, nose &amp; eyes from the fragrance being applied... I seem to remember that it didn''t usually taste as sweet as it smelled.  Glad I took another look as it deserved a higher vote than I initially gave it.</td>', 'You conveyed the mood (an attractive lady, seductively well dressed, the excellent capture of the spray of fragrance, the ring on her finger all convey the ''passion'' mentioned in your title.  The purple tones also enhance and add a seductive quality) & purple, yet the model didn''t  ... after taking another look at your photo I wondered why the models expression didn''t have the same ''passion'' as the rest of the photo?  I''m thinking it may be the ''stance'' of her head to protect the lips, nose & eyes from the fragrance being applied... I seem to remember that it didn''t usually taste as sweet as it smelled.  Glad I took another look as it deserved a higher vote than I initially gave it.', '2004-07-10 15:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(804952, 88350, 15407, '<td valign="top">Very well done!</td>', 'Very well done!', '2004-07-10 15:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
