(805347, 88377, 9668, '<td valign="top">No purple in the picture, Sorry, had to say that. Suggests purple! It fits! One of the better shots I''ve seen that suggests purple. Amazing topic, kinda spooky to me. It looks like the hand is on a women (body curve) but how would the texture be ripping off? Well done. I like that there are red scars on the blue thing, and blue marks on the red hand. The reflections of the flash are a bit annoying. Is the texture paint? Well thought out, good execution, should place highly.</td>', 'No purple in the picture, Sorry, had to say that. Suggests purple! It fits! One of the better shots I''ve seen that suggests purple. Amazing topic, kinda spooky to me. It looks like the hand is on a women (body curve) but how would the texture be ripping off? Well done. I like that there are red scars on the blue thing, and blue marks on the red hand. The reflections of the flash are a bit annoying. Is the texture paint? Well thought out, good execution, should place highly.', '2004-07-10 22:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(805349, 88133, 9668, '<td valign="top">Wierd! Well setup, elements stand out well. Definatly shows purple, I like the glint in the eye.</td>', 'Wierd! Well setup, elements stand out well. Definatly shows purple, I like the glint in the eye.', '2004-07-10 22:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
