(805509, 87237, 2373, '<td valign="top">Very crisp and clear very nice.<br/></td>', 'Very crisp and clear very nice.', '2004-07-11 01:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(805510, 88209, 22734, '<td valign="top">This is a wondeful and funny shot. The model is right on the money. Of course, you complicated your challenge by using the gelatin. here you have a density problem where the the stuff goes from red to almost purple black. You have a very good picture and to make it super all you need do is take the dodger tool and work on the heavy mass to bring out some of the red. In this way, it will match the shade in the mouth. You do not want to overdo it, just enough to give the viewer a little help with the association. Still, it is a very pleasing study.</td>', 'This is a wondeful and funny shot. The model is right on the money. Of course, you complicated your challenge by using the gelatin. here you have a density problem where the the stuff goes from red to almost purple black. You have a very good picture and to make it super all you need do is take the dodger tool and work on the heavy mass to bring out some of the red. In this way, it will match the shade in the mouth. You do not want to overdo it, just enough to give the viewer a little help with the association. Still, it is a very pleasing study.', '2004-07-11 01:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(805511, 88409, 2373, '<td valign="top">I usually dont like pictures of toys and such but this is very nicely done. 8</td>', 'I usually dont like pictures of toys and such but this is very nicely done. 8', '2004-07-11 01:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(805514, 86981, 22734, '<td valign="top">Very nice and magical. The gloves added that extra touch. Since you will keep this special image, I would consider taking the  clone tool and removing some of the wrinkles. This will up the value of this very creative study.</td>', 'Very nice and magical. The gloves added that extra touch. Since you will keep this special image, I would consider taking the  clone tool and removing some of the wrinkles. This will up the value of this very creative study.', '2004-07-11 01:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(805515, 88199, 22734, '<td valign="top">You simply have me fooled here, Very impressive.</td>', 'You simply have me fooled here, Very impressive.', '2004-07-11 01:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(805517, 88390, 2373, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition. Maybe i need to recalobrate my monitor but i just did that not to long ago. The black and white effect seems like it could use some adjusting. <br/>Either way great job-9</td>', 'Very nice composition. Maybe i need to recalobrate my monitor but i just did that not to long ago. The black and white effect seems like it could use some adjusting. Either way great job-9', '2004-07-11 01:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(805519, 88417, 22734, '<td valign="top">I love it!</td>', 'I love it!', '2004-07-11 01:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
