(806272, 87016, 2553, '<td valign="top">Love this!  It''s sharp in some areas, and soft in others but that works well with the "flow" of the subject.  Composition captures my interest,  though I would like to have seen just a bit more of the black background showing through.  Very interesting juxtaposition of lines and curves, and your lighting worked well.</td>', 'Love this!  It''s sharp in some areas, and soft in others but that works well with the "flow" of the subject.  Composition captures my interest,  though I would like to have seen just a bit more of the black background showing through.  Very interesting juxtaposition of lines and curves, and your lighting worked well.', '2004-07-11 19:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
