(806277, 86579, 2553, '<td valign="top">I truly like this.  Somewhat soft focus on the petals, but it does not take away from my enjoyment of the photo.  The lighting and color is very nice, and I love the way that you put the stem and the second flower/stem in the composition.  The composition feels a bit "off" for me, though I honestly can''t say what I would do differently. Overall, this is one of my favorites.</td>', 'I truly like this.  Somewhat soft focus on the petals, but it does not take away from my enjoyment of the photo.  The lighting and color is very nice, and I love the way that you put the stem and the second flower/stem in the composition.  The composition feels a bit "off" for me, though I honestly can''t say what I would do differently. Overall, this is one of my favorites.', '2004-07-11 19:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(806302, 87509, 18349, '<td valign="top">Now that''s a blast from the past...I had some of those back in the 80s...boy, am I getting old!  :o)  Cute take on the challenge; great use of DOF.  :o)</td>', 'Now that''s a blast from the past...I had some of those back in the 80s...boy, am I getting old!  :o)  Cute take on the challenge; great use of DOF.  :o)', '2004-07-11 20:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(806309, 88301, 20925, '<td valign="top">Nice and clean image.  I like all elements, composition, exposure, highlights, etc.  The shadow is curious and gives a lot of motion to the image.  Makes me wonder if the shadow is natural, made by long exposure with a moving light source or done in photoshop.  Maybe my only nit would be the shading in the upper left corner, although it does add some balance to the starkness of the opposite corners.</td>', 'Nice and clean image.  I like all elements, composition, exposure, highlights, etc.  The shadow is curious and gives a lot of motion to the image.  Makes me wonder if the shadow is natural, made by long exposure with a moving light source or done in photoshop.  Maybe my only nit would be the shading in the upper left corner, although it does add some balance to the starkness of the opposite corners.', '2004-07-11 20:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
