(806520, 87685, 12611, '<td valign="top">What happened next? please tell me. did "lovers" sit back on the bed and reflect on the myriad hues of violet and purple in the shot? Did one "lover" say to the other- wow- I love these purple satin sheets and 2 million candle power lamp behind a white umbrella above the bed? I hope not!</td>', 'What happened next? please tell me. did "lovers" sit back on the bed and reflect on the myriad hues of violet and purple in the shot? Did one "lover" say to the other- wow- I love these purple satin sheets and 2 million candle power lamp behind a white umbrella above the bed? I hope not!', '2004-07-11 23:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
