(807645, 86762, 10867, '<td valign="top">Thank you so much, RoB.  I was thrilled, especially after all those really embarrassingly low finishes.  Thanks again for being so thoughtful and generous.</td>', 'Thank you so much, RoB.  I was thrilled, especially after all those really embarrassingly low finishes.  Thanks again for being so thoughtful and generous.', '2004-07-12 17:02:44.000000', NULL, 0),
