(808346, 88342, 7517, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand some of the responses here.  Some of you are displaying your ignorance.  This shot is not edited any more than usual, and this is not a "painting".  This looks like a really well done hand tinted black and white photograph.  What is the big deal.  <br/> <br/>Even if this photo were only in black and white, it would still be a really good photo.  It displays emotion, which is probably one of the hardest things to capture.  Heida has a very good eye for photography, and is a very good photographer despite what some of the comments say.<br/> <br/>As far as the comments go about being an artist as opposed to a photographer, that is a major compliment.  Hopefully we will all graduate from just being a photographer to becoming more of an artist.  <br/> <br/>Nice work Heida, always look forward to seeing your work.</td>', 'I don''t understand some of the responses here.  Some of you are displaying your ignorance.  This shot is not edited any more than usual, and this is not a "painting".  This looks like a really well done hand tinted black and white photograph.  What is the big deal.   Even if this photo were only in black and white, it would still be a really good photo.  It displays emotion, which is probably one of the hardest things to capture.  Heida has a very good eye for photography, and is a very good photographer despite what some of the comments say. As far as the comments go about being an artist as opposed to a photographer, that is a major compliment.  Hopefully we will all graduate from just being a photographer to becoming more of an artist.   Nice work Heida, always look forward to seeing your work.', '2004-07-13 01:08:57.000000', NULL, 0),
