(808578, 88133, 5993, '<td valign="top">I honestly dont know how some people found it offensive.<br/> <br/>Dont "people of colour" eat ice blocks?<br/> <br/>Would it have still been offensive if the model was white, and the photographer had just done a Heida and used to burn tool to remove the colour from everything except the popsicle and the hat and whatever else?<br/> <br/>Unbelievably shallow, people.</td>', 'I honestly dont know how some people found it offensive. Dont "people of colour" eat ice blocks? Would it have still been offensive if the model was white, and the photographer had just done a Heida and used to burn tool to remove the colour from everything except the popsicle and the hat and whatever else? Unbelievably shallow, people.', '2004-07-13 03:52:00.000000', NULL, 0),
