(808584, 88133, 17233, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your top 10 - superb image with great colour and contrast. I gave it a 10 during voting and I would give it a 10 now. I didn''t bother entering into shallow discussions in the current forum thread about whether or not this is offensive and I find the notion completely out of context and made from sheer ignorance.<br/>There is absolutely nothing offensive about it (and we have our fair share of racism here in Australia) - pure art. Extremely well done and an image to be proud of.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-07-13 03:21:47.</i></td>', 'Congrats on your top 10 - superb image with great colour and contrast. I gave it a 10 during voting and I would give it a 10 now. I didn''t bother entering into shallow discussions in the current forum thread about whether or not this is offensive and I find the notion completely out of context and made from sheer ignorance.There is absolutely nothing offensive about it (and we have our fair share of racism here in Australia) - pure art. Extremely well done and an image to be proud of.', '2004-07-13 04:10:14.000000', '2004-07-13 04:21:47.000000', 0),
