(820421, 88342, 22748, '<td valign="top">Mondo beautimus, dude! This is gorgeous.<br/> <br/>I hope to someday create art of the caliber of this piece. Anyone can be a photographer, but to make something that is truly artistically appealing makes you into a real artist.<br/> <br/>So I guess you should accept the compliments that you are, in fact, an artist. :-)</td>', 'Mondo beautimus, dude! This is gorgeous. I hope to someday create art of the caliber of this piece. Anyone can be a photographer, but to make something that is truly artistically appealing makes you into a real artist. So I guess you should accept the compliments that you are, in fact, an artist. :-)', '2004-07-21 15:15:10.000000', NULL, 0),
