(1143817, 88399, 6804, '<td valign="top">What a fun shot! I gave you one of the 10''s on this. This is screaming with colors. It''s clean and well focused and the green really makes the "PURPLE" stand out.  I really like busy shots (And I know I am almost alone in that regard). This is just a feast for the eyes to browse through.  I really like it!</td>', 'What a fun shot! I gave you one of the 10''s on this. This is screaming with colors. It''s clean and well focused and the green really makes the "PURPLE" stand out.  I really like busy shots (And I know I am almost alone in that regard). This is just a feast for the eyes to browse through.  I really like it!', '2005-02-01 01:52:18.000000', NULL, 0),
